<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Onobasulu Translation</book>
  <para style="h">Hibulu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sowi ewe Hibulu Idele Inolofea Seleba Ufulu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hibulu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hib</para>
  <para style="rem">First draft started in Walagu, February 2019. Finished in Walagu Nov 13, 2019: Wabele Fuga, Joseph Hambo, Jack Wasele, Yobe Maibi, Johann Alberts</para>
  <para style="rem">Advisor check of ch 1-6 in Ukarumpa with Wabele Fuga, Jack Wasele, Anne Stoppels in March 2020</para>
  <para style="rem">Advisor check of ch 7-13 in Ukarumpa with Wabele Fuga and Jack Wasele. Anne via Zoom present from the Netherlands. September 2020 (Corona time)</para>
  <para style="rem">CC with Duncan Kasokason Feb 2022 in Walagu</para>
  <para style="rem">after CC corrections in Walagu March 2022 with Joseph Hambo, Felix Waibo and Jack Wasele with Anne Stoppels</para>
  <para style="mt">Hibulu</para>
  <para style="mt2">Sowi Ewe Hibulu Idele Inolofea Seleba Ufulu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Hibulu bugo ewe, inolo abe selelubi, nini babeafe. Inolo noolo asigisia, Folo selelubile, noolo asigisia, Banabasa selelubile, noolo asigisia, Aboloso selelubile, auba asigife. Auluso, bugo eweda selelumo, fadaba soluale dobu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sowi ewe Hibulune keliso idele inolofea seleba melu dobu. Isolaele idele inolo ine sulu sodo amone wimo, Hibulu. Aulune, Isolaele idele inolo ine mosomune wi nomoda, Hibuluba sodo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hibulu sigidubulu idele inolo ilihe, Baibolo Maugaba Selelu (Olpela Kontrak) amo nafuluba dawaloba dulu alolu. Hibulu Sowi ewene sulu kiwi sisa wedinalemo, Baibolo Maugaba Selelu amofea difasia, selelu dobu. Aulugulu, Onobasulu ninihe sowi selelu ewe alegasenaga, sulu ewene kiwi sisa fadaba asigiyomo, wedino kolelu miliyobafe. Ninimo, Isolaele mololumone sadalu anogoda, ine manada, hilisebale ligia, sowi ewe alegasenaga, amo ninihe ewene sawaba hiliseyomo, wedino kolelu miliyobafe. Bama: bugo ewene beba degelalu sunia amone, gahe sadalu ewene baibolo bugo kuliba alegaeyo amone sisa ligi selelu dobi babiyobafe. Kolegilu sulu amo wedinale seleba waalebu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sowi ewe seleiya fogo ami, sesene gisada alolu. Gisa ewehe Hibulu sese idele inolo elasabiasia, higiniludai, nagadai, ilifea meba yaalu. Auba molosimo, noolo kiwi sanesia, ine asigi ule ufulumo afaliyo weiyaalu. Sowi selelu ewemo, ilihe Yesufea asigi ule ufulumo kiwigaafia fedoba semesi aulu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ausiamo, Godehe dabalu bule Yesu Kelisofea alefasia mololu amone, sowi ewehe ilifea solu. Auba selesiamo, sulu kiwi biniba saaba ufulu. Aufia, sulu biniba ewefeamo hagugubadai selaba yaalu dobu.</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Yesu E Godene sulu dia ano wasolu labe. (Lalolu 1-2) Saminimo, Godene sulu dia anone sone alefasia, Isolaele idele inolofea muguli selelu melumone, sulu amo ili dofasia kuliba maiyo dobu. Yesu E-mo, Godene sulu dia ano wasolu labegulu, ninihe Ene sulu dofasia, kuliba maiyoba.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Yesu E Mosese wasolu labe. (Lalolu 3-4) Mosesehe Isolaele idele inolo ulubia daalu. Ili ene sulu dobelesiale habosimo, ili saaba ufulu hele ami sugaeyodoluale alolu. Yesu E-mo, Mosese wasolugulu, gili Godene halemane asela amimo maa sugalosi, Efea habomabiyo.</para>
  <para style="ip">3. Yesu E Soba Melone Guni Inolo ligia, Melekisedeke hamagulu labe. (Lalolu 5-7) Aulugulu, Ehe Isolaelene soba melone guni inolo ilimo wasolu labe. Aulune, seloaba ofa dabalu E mololumofea, faiso memabiyo.</para>
  <para style="ip">4. Yesu Ehe Ene meleba ulu melu. (Lalolu 8-10) Samini, Isolaele soba melo inolo ilihe, idele inolone wolu heeba dafiyone, hamu sunia ule uleba, saabia saabiaba kelebulu soba melo. Auluso, kelebulu ibihe idele inolone wolu seale heeba dafaliluale. Auluso, Yesu fogo ule hamagi, Ene meleba ulu melu alefasia, Ehe idele inolo wolu mololu amone su suluba melu. Aulune, gilihe Yesune ibi amomo balubusia, hamabiyo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hibulu idele inolo kiwigaaba ufiyone, sulu eweda gegoaba seleba ofelefe: samini Isolaele idele inolo asigi ule ufulu kolelu adaaba yaalu amone, sulu wedinale selelu dobu. (Lalolu 11) Ewe selesia, “Hama, higinilu halagulu gili labea goasimo, gilihe gine asigi ule ufulumo, fedoba sefia abia olasia hamale. Gili koleba Yesusu sidafia abia, Ene manasu kuliba malale. Aufia, gili koleba, nagada, higiniluda, gili dife ogomo suniamale.”</para>
  <para style="ip">Elosia, kiwigaaba sulu nooloda selefe. (Lalolu 12-13)</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry 99and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Godehe Ene Faibefea alefasia, sulu saaba samodoba selesi, nini dubulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Saminimo, hilia wedinale ami, Godehe nine nauwadali ilifea sulu saeyo ligiamo, eno nokene nokenebafea alefasia ami, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo ine mofeyofea alefasia sodo. <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:3">Yon 1.3</ref></char></note>Auluso, aga aleba eloyo hilia adefe iwimo, Godehe Ene Faibefea alefasia, sulu ninifea saaba melabia mulu. Ene Faibe amone sonefea alefasia, Ehe helefealuda, anakiwida, mololu. Aufia, Ehe Ene daalo kegele suniamo, Ene Faibe yasifia uluba melesi iminiba ufulu. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:9">Yon 14.9</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:20">Kol 1.20</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 8:1">Hib 8.1</ref></char></note>Godene yane <char style="w">elalelu</char> bule neeba doweba ado amo, Faibe amo E. Aufia, Gode Ene mimisililu waagulumo, Ene Faibe hamaga koleba labe. Ene sulu kiwida amohe, kegele sunia fedoba sefia labe. Ene miliyolu weasefasiamo, idele inolone <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolumo</char> heesia, galagololu gadefasia ami, E-mo hebene lagi, Kini Olaibo amone sone lilibefealomo yoba asefia labe.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godene Faibe amohe, Godene sulu dia ano ilimo wasolu labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 2:9">Fil 2.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Godehe wi Efea melu amomo, sulu dia ano ine wimo wasolu dobu. Enebamo, Ehe, olaibo koleba ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Godene sulu dia anomo</char> sunia suniafia, wasolu labe. Sulu ewene kiwimo, bugo samini selelu amone kiwigaaba ofelesia, eweguba selefe. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sng 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:33">HD 13.33</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:14">2Sml 7.14</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:13">1Sto 17.13</ref></char></note>Samini Godehe Ene Faibefea eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 1:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">
    <char style="qt">“Ga-mo, Ne Naalo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">
    <char style="qt">Aga Na-mo, ge Gao adesu.”</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 1:5" />
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Aufia, E haiba eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 1:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">
    <char style="qt">“Na-mo, Ene Enao labi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">
    <char style="qt">E-mo, Ne Naalo miliyobafe.”</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 1:5" />
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Godehe Ene Faibefea auba solubiyo. Auluso, Ehe Ene sulu dia ano ulenofea sulu aubada solualebiyo. <verse eid="HEB 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Lo 32.43</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:29">Lom 8.29</ref></char></note>Aufia, haiba saabia, Godehe Ene Faibe olaibomo helefealu iwi ulubia inigiamo, Ehe eweguba selefe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 1:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:6">
    <char style="qt">“Ne sulu dia ano, gili suniahe, Efeasu gulugulumale.”</char><verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:4">Sng 104.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Ehe Ene sulu dia ano ili amone saaba, eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 1:7" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">
    <char style="qt">“Nahe Ne sulu dia ano ili amomo fufulogulu moloba waalelu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, ili Ne dabalu molomesi, Nahe ilimo de waiya kolelugulu moloba waalelu.”</char><verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.8-9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 45:6-7">Sng 45.6-7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, Ene Faibefeamo Ehe eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 1:8" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">
    <char style="qt">Ga Gode, Ga-mo, Ge kinine asefalu ailaiya ami,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">
    <char style="qt">alefalu yoba sigia, Ga Saminilo labe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">
    <char style="qt">Auba ligia, Ga Ge yalo sefia ligia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">
    <char style="qt">idele inolo nafulu alebaimesi, isoba yasifia uluba ado.</char><verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />
    <char style="qt">Gahe mana isolu kolebamo hamesesia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">
    <char style="qt">mana wolu kolebamo Ga gogoloba bolo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">
    <char style="qt">Aulugulu, Gode, Nahe henelo amone walea hano Ge gunia sagasia, Ga iminiba ufulu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">
    <char style="qt">Auba ausimo, Ga henesia ibaba diasisia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">
    <char style="qt">ge sama sunia waselesia, ana gadefalu labe.</char><verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.10-12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:25-27">Sng 102.25-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Godehe Ene bugo usu, fogo no ami, Ene Faibefea haiba saabia eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 1:10" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">
    <char style="qt">“<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, maugabamo, Gahe helefealu iwi ikau geba waalefasia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">
    <char style="qt">Ge sone alefasia, anakiwi sunia moloba ufulu.</char><verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />
    <char style="qt">Anakiwidai, helefealudai, asigileyobafeso,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">
    <char style="qt">Ga-sumo waagi alefaeyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">
    <char style="qt">Aidamo, fagulo amakelelu bibidiba dafaliloguba, bidiba dafaliyobafe.</char><verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />
    <char style="qt">Gahe helefealudai, anakiwidaimo, ifagulo homogologuba, homogoyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">
    <char style="qt">Kegele aida amo, inolohe fagulo hili no bedologuba, bedoyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">
    <char style="qt">Auluso, Ga-sumo, Gene alefalu waagulu miliyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, Ge hamumo eloyobafale.”</char><verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sng 110.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fogo no, Godehe Ene Faibefea eweguba solubiyo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 1:13" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">
    <char style="qt">Ga-mo, Ne sone ililibefealo iwi yoba misiyo mila.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">
    <char style="qt">Ga ami yoba saabimo, Nahe Ge gisa suniamo, Ge emo sisa diba ufiyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 1:13" />
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:13">Godehe sulu amogubamo Ene sulu dia ano ulenofea aubada soluale. <verse eid="HEB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:7">Sng 34.7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 91:11">91.11</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, Godene sulu dia ano ilimo, abe kolebabi? Ilimo asubane ligia, Godene dabalu mololo adaaba yaalo. Godehe ilifea Ene idele inolomo sagoba ofalaba yaamalesia, hilibaisalo. Auba hilibaisafia ligia, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> diyobafe idele inolo amone, sagoba ofalaba yaalo.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Nini heleba anosi, sulu haguguba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Godene Faibemo wi bule wasolu kolebamo auba dulugulu, sulu samini nini dofasia, sigiba dubulumo, nini heleba muba dibia anosi, auba fedoba sefia, nafuluba asigiba mela. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:19">Gal 3.19</ref></char></note>Maumo, samini Godehe nine nauwadalifea <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Ene sulu dia ano</char> ine mofeyofea alefasia, sulu muguli melu. Sulu muguli auba melu amo, saaba ofalu koleba dobu. Aulugulu, idele inolohe sulu amo dofasia, gelefia saidafulu ili amo, auba mololu amone elebe sabe isoba dulu.<verse eid="HEB 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 10:29">Hib 10.29</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:25">12.25</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, aga Godehe nini <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> diyone molosiamo, eno hili no molofasia, ninifea saaba ufulu. Aulugulu, ninihe gasiba dafelagoba diyone eno amo golaba bisigia, eno amofea faiso mesenaga, ninimo elebe sabe diyobafe amone elaba dafelesia, siba daafia maiyobafeba hilisefela? Auba hilisemabiyo koleba. Gasiba dafelagoba diyone eno amone, nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu Keliso, Edale ninifea ulufaba moloba walelu. Aufia, inolo sulu E selesi koneni dubulu amo ili amoda, sulu ule hamagane ninifea sealeba waleso. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:20">Mag 16.20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 12:4">1Kld 12.4</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 12:11">11</ref></char></note>Sulu amo sealeba ulufaba saaba dafelagosia, Godehe eloba bamesi <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> nokene nokeneba moloba yaalu. Aufia, Godehe Ene hame kuliba abia, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenene</char> ulu kegele amo, idele inolo inefea osolaba meba ado.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ninida gasiba diyo inolo olaibomo, Yesu E labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Nini gasiba dafelagoba diyone selesiamo, nini helefealu hili holobagaeyobafe amoneda selaba lolu. Helefealu hili amo yasimesine, Godehe Ene <char style="w">sulu dia ano</char> ilifea gadefaluale. Aubale. Ene Faibefea yasifia uluba melesi gadefalu. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:4-6">Sng 8.4-6</ref></char></note>Godene bugo usu, inolo uleno sulu eweguba solu. Sulu amohe sulu lagi solumo kiwigaaba ofelefe. Sulu amo, ewe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 2:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">
    <char style="qt">Helefealu inolomo, wida male labe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">
    <char style="qt">Auluso, Gode, Ga koleba e asigi gagabasu labego. Enesi ause?</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">
    <char style="qt">Gahe <char style="w">inololene faibe</char> uluba labe ogo. Enesi ause?</char><verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />
    <char style="qt">Fogo bilale ami, Gahe e-mo Ge sulu dia ano ili sisa melesi gadefafia alolu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:7">
    <char style="qt">Aufasia, Gahe ene wi digiba ofelesia, wabialelo amodai kaaba ufulu.</char><verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />
    <char style="qt">Aufia, Gahe kegele sunia ene emo sisa diba ufulu.</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 2:8" />
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Kegele sunia E sisa diba ufuluba selefe amomo, kegele uleno afelesiale, sunia koleba ufuluba selefe. Auluso, agamo, kegele sunia E sisa diba ufulubamo, nini aso bosoluale. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:8-9">Fil 2.8-9</ref></char></note>Aubale. Auluso, aga ninihe Yesu E bosolu. Fogo bilale amimo, Godehe Yesu E-mo <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Ene sulu dia ano</char> ili sisa melesi ami gadefalu. Ausi, Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> mana amo alefasia, Yesuhe idele inolo sunia alibiasia, ine fogomo disia, naga bule diabia abia, E olalu. Aulune, Godehe Ene wi digiba ofelesia, Efea wabialelo melu.<verse eid="HEB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Helefealu kegele dobu ewe sunia, Gode Efeasu alefasia, Enesu moloba dafelagobu. Auba mololumo, Gode Ehe, idele inolo wedinale Ene faibili alebaimesifia, ilimo Ene elaleiya uluba dibia miyo hamelu. Ili auba uluba dibia miyone eno amo sogoyonemo, Godehe Yesu naga dulu amo alefasia, E auba moloba samodosia elolu. Yesu E ine Saminilo ligia, Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> diyone eno ami saminiba abia, ili uluba dibia aafe. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:40">Mad 25.40</ref></char></note>Yesuhe idele inolo Godene <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu melesi moloba ofolo">muuba kalilu mosomu melesi moloba ofelefe</char>. <char style="w">Muuba kalilu</char> alebaimesi moloba ufia labe Eda, aufia muuba kalilu moloba ufulu alebaibu ili amoda, ili Ulefea alefasia, ua labe. Aulune, Yesu Ehe ilifea Ne nelewodali, Ne nanodaliba saeyomo yualale. <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:22">Sng 22.22</ref></char></note>Aubale. Ehe Godefea eweguba selefe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 2:12" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">
    <char style="qt">Ge wi bulemo, Nahe nelewodali nanodalifea ulufa fadaba saeyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">
    <char style="qt">Ili gagaiyofia, gulugulufea aleba amimo, Nahe Ge wimo digisia, gasa saeyobasu.</char><verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:17-18">Ais 8.17-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, saabia E selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 2:13" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">
    <char style="qt">Ne asigi ule ufiyomo, Godefea ufiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 2:13" />
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Aufia, E saabia selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 2:13" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">
    <char style="qt">Na bama. Aufia, faibili Godehe Nafea meba yaalu eweda bama.</char><verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 3:8">1Yon 3.8</ref>; <ref loc="REV 12:10">MUU 12.10</ref></char>
    </note>Faibili ili amo, helefealu iwi ligia, huuda, ibida alolu idele inolo alebaibu. Aulune, Yesu Eda, huuda, ibida inolo alolu. E auba idele inolo waagulu alolu ligia, Ehe olalone kiwigagaluda sebu e-mo woba dafiyone, olalu. Olalone kiwigagaluda sebu amo, <char style="w">henane</char> labe. <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />Helefealu iwi sigiamo, idele inolo ilimo hilia sunia olaeyomo sagililo. Sagililo amohe, idele inolo dibologulu yalaba galifia alolu. Auluso, Yesu E huuda, ibida alolu ligia, olalumo alefasia, Ehe dibolo adaaba yaalu ili amo sububa dafogolu.<verse eid="HEB 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Seale koleba. Yesuhe dabalu mololu amomo, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> ili amone sagoba ufiyone mololuale. Aubale. E dabalu mololu amomo, <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamane</char> enauwadali amone sagoba ofelesia mololu. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Mau ewe alefasia, Yesu E-mo, Ene elewodali, enanodali, alibiayone, eno no male labi, E ili waagulu koleba, huuda, ibida, inolole alolu. Auba ausiamo, E-mo ine <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">Soba Melone Guni Inolo</char> adesia, Ehe Godene dabalu fedoba sefia moloba ligia, ilifea kanulufia, Godedai, ilidai, olea labe. Auba olea ligia, Ehe idele inolone <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> heesia, seloaba ofolaba labe. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Mau enebamo, E huuda alolu ligia, dedeba babiyo Efeada holobagasi, Eda naga dulu. Eda auba naga dulune, idele inolofea dedeba babiyo holobagasimo, E isoba sagoba ufiyo labe. <figure style="fig" alt="Crucifixion" file="BA03031.tif" size="col" copy="used with permission of Louise Bass" ref="2.14-15">Yesu olalumohe, olalone kiwigagalu dufa dafogolu.</figure><verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu E wasolu koleba labene, nini Efeasu asigi gagaba miliyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 4:14">Hib 4.14</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 7:26">7.26</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 12:7">Nam 12.7</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, ne <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> damenedali, <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> Ulenohe nini ua welu alebaibu. Gili koleba Yesufea asigi gagaba mela. Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibailu inolomo</char>, Yesu E labe. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">Soba Melone Guni Inolomo</char>, E waaga labe. Ninihe Efea asigi ule ofasia, Ene wi fogaba selaba lolu. Efeasu asigi gagaba mela.<verse eid="HEB 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E Mosese wasolu labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />
    <char style="w">Mosese</char> ehe, Godene molo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Godene molo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amomo, Isolaele mosomu iminiba selesia, besi solu. Nini Onobasulu <char style="it">Yose molo</char>ba sodoguba, ilida <char style="it">molo</char>ba selefemo auba iminisia sodo.</char></note> usu kegele uluba adaaba ligiamo, nafuluba yasifia fedoba sefia alolu. Yesu Eda, amogubasu, Eda iminiba ufulu amone sulumo fedoba sefia alolu. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3-4" />Helefealu iwimo, molo sunia inolone sone dulu alebaibu. Auluso, kegele mololu sunia, Godene sone mololu. Molone wimo, ulenohe wabialelale. Aubale. Moloda dulu e-mo, ene wimo, idele inolo ilihe wabialesia ana ofolo. Amogubasu, Yesune wi wabialefe amohe, Mosesene wi wasolu labe.<verse eid="HEB 3:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 12:7">Nam 12.7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15-19">Lo 18.15-19</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">Mosese e Godene sagoba ofolo ligia, ehe Godene molo usu kegele uluba adaaba ligiamo, nafuluba yasifia ligia, fedoba sefia alolu.</char> E dabalu auba fedoba sefia ligia, Gode sagoba ofelesia, dufia saeyobafe sulu amone, ehe ulufaba saaba dafelagoba alolu. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Auluso, Mosese e-mo Godene molo usu sagoba ofolo aloluguba, Keliso E koleba auba molofale. Aubale. E Godene Faibe koleba ligia, Godene molo amone biso labe. E fedoba sefia yasifia ligia, molo amo gasiagufia labe. Molo amomo, nini koleba. Nini yuasia sagilisiale, asigi kiwigaafia, kaiifia ligia, nini diyo amone <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofelagofia yasifia</char>, fedoba sefia adesenaga, amo nini Godene molo amone alebaibu.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuhe Mosese wasolu labemone, ninihe Ene sulu saidafalimabiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.7-9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Sng 95.7-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulune, <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> selefeguba molomale. E Godene bugo usu eweguba selefe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 3:7" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:7">
    <char style="qt">Aga yagi, gilihe Godene sulu goo dobelesenaga,</char><verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 17:7">Kis 17.7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:2-5">Nam 20.2-5</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">gili gine asigi kolemabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">
    <char style="qt">Samini, gine gauwadali ilihe Nafea eleliya fogo ami,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">
    <char style="qt">Ne sulu saidafelesia, ine asigi kolelubiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">
    <char style="qt">Gilida auba molomabiyo.</char><verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />
    <char style="qt">Hele falaiya siba aloiya fogo ami, gine gauwadalihe Na auba dedeba besabeo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:9">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, hamu daabuluba biniba aleba amimo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:9">
    <char style="qt">ili koleba Na molosomo abuluso, ilihe ine asigi kolefiasu adeso.</char><verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />
    <char style="qt">Aulune, Nahe saladegelu ili amodai habosiamo, ili saaba eweguba solu.</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 3:10" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">
    <char style="qt">“Hilia sunia, ine asigine libomo heleba dedalesia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">
    <char style="qt">mana Na molosomo nafuluba asigisialene, ili kuliba dedalefale.”</char><verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:21-23">Nam 14.21-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">Aulugulu, Na gadisiamo, ilifea eweguba <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiiba</char> kaasia solu.</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 3:11" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:11">
    <char style="qt">“Ne halemane asela ami faseba sugaeyobafale koleba.”</char><verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Ne damenedali, gili nafuluba bamale. Gili aleba ugi ulenohe, ene asigine libomo, wolusu koleba adosi, nafuluba beaba melale. Aufia, ulenohe Gode bebea labe amofea faiso mesia, Efea asigi ule maa ofolosi, nafuluba melale.<verse eid="HEB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Godehe aso fogo meba labi, ninihe aso <char style="it">hilia aga yagi</char>ba saeyone fogo dobimo, gili gine geleba hilia sunia kiwigaaba ofolabasu melale. <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">Woluhe</char> gili gegesimo, gili aleba ugi uleno ene libo kaasia, kolelosine, auba kiwigaaba ofolabasu melale.<verse eid="HEB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Nini maugaba Godefea asigi ule ofelesiamo, nini asigi ule ufulumo kolelu alebailu. Aulugulu, nini koleba, asigi ule ufulu amone fedoba kalugaafia ligia, elosia samodosenaga, amo nini Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisodai</char> sama adesia, Efea ua osolaba dilo alebaibu. <verse eid="HEB 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7">Sng 95.7</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 95:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 3:7-8">Hib 3.7-8</ref></char></note>Lagi solu dobumo, asigima. Sulu ewe aso ufiasu labe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 3:15" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">
    <char style="qt">Aga yagi, gilihe Godene sulu goo dobelesenaga,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">
    <char style="qt">gilihe gine asigi kolemabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">
    <char style="qt">Samini, gilihe Nafea eleliya fogo ami, gine asigi koleluguba,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">
    <char style="qt">agada auba kolemabiyo.</char><verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 14:1-35">Nam 14.1-35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele inolohe Godene sulu selefe dofasia, saidafelesia, Efea elelilu, ili amo abe? <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesehe</char> ili Isibi hele amifia sububa dafelagosi, holobagagafia dedalelu ili amola? Ee, ili amo koleba. <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:10">1Kld 10.10</ref></char></note>Aufia, hamu daabuluba biniba aleba amimo, Godehe abefea habolu? Idele inolo woluda molosia waalelu ili amofea, E habolu. Ausi, ili sunia hele falaiya hamagi daneba yaasi, ine domalamo ami afolaba yaalu dobu. <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Aufia, “Ne halemane asela ami faseba sugaeyobafalebamo,” Godehe abefea aiiba kaasia solu? Idele inolo Ene sulu saidafulu ili amofea, Ehe auba aiiba solu. <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Aulugulu, ninimo eweguba bosolu. Idele inolo halemane asela ami faseba sugaeyodolualemone maumo, ili Godefea asigi ule ufuluale.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="s">Asigi ule ufulu idele inolohe Godene halemane asela ami faseba sugafe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Godene halemane asela ami sugamesiba, oloba huliale saaba ufulu. Saaba ufulu sulu amo, agada aso ufiasu labe. Aulune, gili nafuluba koleba. Gili aleba ugi, noolo ama sugafia labi, gili ami dufia goalosi, sagilisia enogele melale. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Enebamo, samini Isolaele ilifea awalu sulu nafulu saaba mesi dubulu, aubasu ninida dubulu. Auluso, ili sulu amo dobelesiamo, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofale</char> dubulu. Aulune, sulu amohe ili sagoba ufuluale. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Sng 95.11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 3:11">Hib 3.11</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, Godehe ili saaba eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 4:3" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">
    <char style="qt">“Na gadisia, eweguba <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiiba</char> kaasia solu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">
    <char style="qt">‘Ilihe Ne halemane asela ami faseba sugaeyobafale koleba.’ ”</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 4:3" />
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Auluso, nini Godefea <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> idele inolo amo, nini aga Ene halemane asela ami faseba sugaba lolu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 4:3">Godehe helefealu aso molosia waagi, Ene dabalu moloba samodolu. Nini auba asigibu. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:2">Stt 2.2</ref></char></note>Enebamo, hilia domo amone saaba, Godene bugo usu fogo uleno ami, eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">Hilia domo amimo, Godehe Ene dabalu moloba alolumo samodolu baafia, E ami halemane alolu.</char> <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Sng 95.11</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, maugaiya hamagifia, Godene halemane asela amo ama dobu. Aufia, sulu haisi nini maugaba lagi abulu amo, Ehe eweguba selefe. <char style="qt">Ilihe Ne halemane asela ami faseba sugaeyobafale koleba.</char> <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Idele inolo samini awalu sulu nafulu ilifea solumo dofasia, Ene sulu saidafulune, mau amo alefasia, ili amo halemane asela ami sugaluale. Auluso, noolofea halemane asela ami faseba sugamesine, aso fogo dobu. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 95:7-8">Sng 95.7-8</ref></char></note>Waagi sugaeyone fogo aso dobu amo, nini eweguba hilisebu. Idele inolo sulu saidafelesia, halemane asela ami sugalualeiya amifia, hamu wedinale daafia, Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> mofeyofeafia eweguba solu. Sulu ewe, ama ana lagida seleba dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 4:7" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">
    <char style="qt">“Aga yagi, gilihe Godene sulu goo dobelesenaga,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">
    <char style="qt">gili gine asigi kolemabiyo.”</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 4:7" />
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:7">Aulune, “aga yagiba” solu amohe ninifea walesia, Godehe idele inolo ilimo ami waagi sugamesifia, haiba hilia no gadefaluba walefe. <verse eid="HEB 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:7">Lo 31.7</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 22:4">Jos 22.4</ref></char></note>Samini, <char style="w" lemma="Yosua">Yosuahe</char> Isolaele idele inolo uluba dulu fogo ami, ilifea halemane misiyoda hele kolebamo ama melubiaga, amo dufia Godehe halemane misiyo hilia nomo haiba saaba ofaiyale.<verse eid="HEB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Aulune, halemane misiyo hilia nomo, Godene idele inolo ninifea aso waagi ufiasu labe. Godehe Sabada hiliahe halemane alolu amoguba moloyobafe. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:4">Hib 4.4</ref></char></note>Gode E dabalu moloba samodofia, halemane alolu amogubamo, idele inolo abehe Godene halemane misiyo hele amo sugasenaga, ilida ine dabalu moloba samodosiamo, halemane misiyobafe. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Aulune, ili samini sulu saidafulune mana amo kuliba abia gelebailosine, nini halemane amo kegele baluba hilisemabiyo. Aubale. Nini halemane asela ami faseba sugaeyone, nini nine asigida, kiwida, sunia meyoba.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:17">Efe 6.17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:16">MUU 1.16</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:13-15">19.13-15</ref></char>
    </note>Godene sulu bebea ligia, dabalu fefedeba kiwigaaba moloba labe. Sulu amo, helebesi nolobaloda minilu, nolobaloda minilu, amogulu ligia, si nokene labe. Helebesi amohe oloba iligifia, kiwi hugulumo kukulibia ami goafia, kiwidai, kiwi nologodai, dasigaba dafelefe. Amogubasu, Godene sulu amohe, nine <char style="w" lemma="Asigine libo">asigine libodai</char>, asubanedai aleba ami, sugafia odesia, dasigaba dafolo. Ausiamo, sulu amohe, nine asigi suniada, nine libone hame dobuda, nafuluba dasigaba dafolo. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Kegele Gode mololu amo sunia, uleno Godene si saabiamo mugubada dobuale kolebabu. Ene si saabiamo, kegele sunia fisigafia, ulufa diba waalebu. Nini moloba alolumo sunia Efea saeyogulu, Ehe ninifea fadaasia mau waneyobafe.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E nine Soba Melone Guni Inolo bule koleba ligia, Godedai ninidai olea labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 3:1">Hib 3.1</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:23">10.23</ref></char>
    </note>Godehe kegele sunia boloba hilisesia, ninihe Yesufea asigi ule ufuluba solumo fedoba sefia melale. Enebamo, Yesu, Godene Faibe amo E, nine <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">Soba Melone Guni Inolo</char> bule kolebamo, E labe. E <char style="w">hebene</char> suniaba sugafia, yoba saabemo, Godedai, ninidai, olea inolo, E saabe. Aulune, ninihe Efea asigi ule ufulumo fedoba sefia melale. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Enebamo, nine Soba Melone Guni Inolo ewemo, nini kiwi sanelu adesimo, E ninifea yagunagafia sagolale inolo amoale. Aubale. <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">Wolu</char> suniafealomo, ninifea dedeba besabeguba, Ene Efeada dedeba abulu. Auluso, dedeba besabimo, E wolu mololuale. Ene Efeada auba dedeba abulumone, E ninifea yagunafia sagoba ofelefe. E auba ninidai, Godedai, olea ligia, nine soba melo inolo labe. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:19">Hib 10.19</ref></char></note>Ausi, E koleba olea ami labeba hilisesia, nini asigi kiwigaafia abia, yuasia sagilibale ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">Kanululone</char> asefalu ailaiya ami, E hagoaleba maiyoba. Aufia, nini E labea goasimo, Ehe nini yagunagafia kanuluyobafe. Aufia, nini higinilu difeiya hamagimo, Ehe Ene kanululo alefasia, nini sagoba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="s">Helefealune soba melone guni inolo eweguba ado</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Helefealu iwi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> labe amo, e idele inolo aleba amifia molobebelefia gadefalu labe. E-mo, idele inolo ili amo adoguba, ine hele fogomo disia, Godedai, ilidai, olea kalugaamesi gadefalu labe. Soba melone guni inolo ligiamo, ehe ene dabalu molosiamo, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> heeba dafalimesine, ulu kegele Godefea soba meba yaalo. <figure style="fig" alt="High Priest" file="02_Ex_28_06_RG.jpg" size="col" loc="5.1" copy="Sweet Publication" ref="5.1">Soba melone guni inolo</figure> <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Idele inolo ili babeasia, heleba aasimo, soba melo inolo ehe, ili amo yagunagasia, esebalo ado. Maumo, ene eda kiwi sanelu hamagulu labe. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Wkp 9.7</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 16:6">16.6</ref></char></note>E auba kiwi sanelu labemone, ehe idele inolone wolu amosu heemesifia mololale. Aubale. Ehe ene wolu mololu amoda heemesisia, Godefea soba meyo dobu. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Kis 28.1</ref></char></note>Inolo soba melone guni inolo gadefasi adefe amo, e wida bule ado. Auluso, inolo ulenohe wabialelo dabalu amo, ene hamefeguba dilale. Aubale. Godehe inolo welumo, dabalu amo e diyobafe. Godehe samini <char style="w" lemma="Alono">Alonoda</char> aubasu welu.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E soba melo bule nokene labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sng 2.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Eno amogubasu, <char style="w">Keliso</char> Eda <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolone</char> wabialelo dabalu amo, Ene hamefeguba duluale. Aubale. Gode Efea selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 5:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">
    <char style="qt">“Ga-mo, Ne Naalo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">
    <char style="qt">Aga Na-mo, Ge Gao adesu.”</char><verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:4">Sng 110.4</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 6:20">Hib 6.20</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 7:1">7.1</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, sulu selelu nomo, Gode eweguba solu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 5:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">
    <char style="qt">“Ga-mo, <char style="w" lemma="Melekisedeke">Melekisedekene</char> eno kuliba inigia mulumo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">
    <char style="qt">Ga <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> alefalu labe.”</char><verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mad 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:6-8">Fil 2.6-8</ref></char>
    </note>Yesu E helefealu iwi, huuda inolo aloiya fogo ami, E Godedai sulu kiwigaaba selaba ado. Godehe E olaeyalene <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba dimesiba</char> hilisesia, E <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selesiamo</char>, susiba, si hanodaiba yeeba ligia, koleba selaba alolu. E, Ene hame dufa dafogofia, Gode sisa ligia selesi, Godehe E selefemo dubulu. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Yesu E-mo, Godene faibe aloluso, naga E difeiya amifia, Gode sisa ligia, Ene sulu dobelesia kuliba maiyo mana amone fadaba dawalolo dulu. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Mana E auba mololu amo alefasia, Godehe E ililiba isoba moloba samodolu. E auba moloba ofasia ligia, E-mo idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> diyo amone alefalu maumo, E labe. Idele inolo Ene sulu dofasia, kuliba dedalefe ili amomo, Ehe gasiba dafelagoba dife. <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />Aulugulu, Godehe Yesu E-mo, soba melone guni inolo Melekisedeke e dabalu mololo amoguba, molomesi iminiba ufulu.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nini subobogulu melabiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Nini alefasia, sulu ewenemo, gilifea wedinale saeyo dobuso, ulufaba fadaba saeyomo kolefe. Mau enebamo, gili sulu selefemo dofasia, alebale difale. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:1-3">1Kld 3.1-3</ref></char></note>Gili keliso idele inolo samini alebailubasi. Gili keliso miliyo maugaiya amifia, inigia, hilia aga goasi, fogo alegasenaga, gilimo walelo waagi isoba miliyodolu alebaiyo. Auluso, gilimo asigi difalene, Godene sulu mana hili maugaba dubulumo, aso asigiba diyodoluale adesi, noolohe gilifea haiba saabia no waleyodolu adefe. Gili faibe subobogulu adesia, naiyo kolelu nabiale, bu hanosu aso naba labe. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Idele inolo abehe busu naba labe ili amo, faibe subobogulu aso ligia, isolu moloba walelu amo, ili aso babealu labe. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Auluso, naiyo kolelumo, inolo bulelu nolo. Inolo auba bulelu amogulumo, ilihe wolu ewebu, nafulu ewebuba, dawaloba eloba bisigia, ine asigimo sawalu miliyobafe. Enebamo, ili hilia sunia, auba babiyone ine meleba dedeba moloba ado.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1-2" />Aulugulu, nini bu hano nolomo afasia, naiyo kolelu nabia, bulema! Maugaba <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisofea</char> <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufuluiya</char> ami, mana fogo ami walelu amo, bu hano afologuba, afelesia suniafia abia, nine asigi ule ufulu bulesia, asidalu miliyone asigi diabia malale.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 6:1-2">Ninihe molo disiamo, ikau gefasia, molo ele diabia maiyone aulo. Nini ikausu gebasu adesenaga, amo molo ele holobagaeyobafale koleba. Amogubasu, maugaba asigi ule ufuluiya ami, mana walelumo, ikau gelu amogulu labe. Mana walelu amo ewe. Olalofealo ulubia aafe mana amofealomo, nolofia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besima</char>. Aufia, Godefea asigi ule homa. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gema</char>. Aufia, guni saabia sone ufulu mela. Aufia, danelu <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeyobafeba</char> asigiba dulu mela. Aufia, Godehe osolaba dafelesia sulu selefemo, haiba no dedegeyobafale. Aubale, sulu amo alefalu miliyobafeba asigiba dulu mela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 6:1-2">Mana amo waleiya amisu, aso yoba melabiyo. Aubale. Ninihe aga molo ele holobagamesi diabia abia, asidalu miliyone asigi diabia malale. <verse eid="HEB 6:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Gode alefasia, ninifea molomesi fogo mesenaga, amo nini auba moloyo.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Asigi ule ufulu idele inolo asidalumo, ili eweguba labe. Godene yanemo ilifea neeba dowesi, ine asigi sawalu labe. Ilimo <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenene</char> ulu kegele<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hebenene ulu kegele</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefemo, Godene kanululo amone selefe.</char></note> amone nenalebalu, naba abulu labe. Aufia, ili sunia <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane Noekenemo</char> ua osolaba dulu labe. <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />Aufia, Godehe ine libo usu sulu selesi dofasia, sulu amo naba baafia, nenalebalu koleba abulu labe. Gode yasifia miliyobafe amone kiwigagalu ili gesi, abulu labe. <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mad 10.22</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:26-27">Hib 10.26-27</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 5:16">1Yon 5.16</ref></char></note>Nafuluba. Idele inolo auba bulelu ligia, ili Gode hamasia, afa aasenaga, ili haiba asigi besiba obegeyone eno male koleba miliyobafe. Enebamo, auba hamaba selefe amo alefasia, ili ine sonehe Godene Faibe E-mo, saabia no haiba imolane uluba ofelefe. Ausiamo, ilihe E idele inolo si saabia yuaba ofelefe.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Sulu lagi solu amone, na besi sulu eweguba selesu. Hilia fogo wedinale, helemo geiya sugasi, gelu amohe hano amo naba ado. Ausi, sebe nafulu helelelo. Sebe amomo, idele inolo sagoba ofolo. Gelumo auba molomesifia, gelu dobu. Aulugulu, gelu auba molofe amosu, Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba</char> ofolo. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-18">Stt 3.17-18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:7">Mad 13.7</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:22">22</ref></char></note>Auluso, geiya amimo, sebe nafulu helelesiale, didiganedai, gisi woludai, amosu sobosenaga, gelu amo eleda male adefe. Gelu amofea kanoba saeyomo hagoalefe. Gelu amo de soba samodoyobafe.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Nine yagusodali koleba, gili doma. Ninihe auba hagugulu sulu safasia, aga gilifea eweguba selesu. Sulu lagi solumo, gilifea holobagaeyobafale. Amone nini kiwigaaba asigifia lolu. Gilifea holobagaeyobafe amo, nafulu koleba labe. Godehe gili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> obegeba duluiya amifia, kegele nafulu amo holobagaeyobafe. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:32-34">Hib 10.32-34</ref></char></note>Gode woluale labe. Ehe sabe mesia isosiamo, isolu ligia, sabe melo. Aulune, mana nafulu gili mololu amone, Ehe asigi galilale. Aufia, gilihe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> sagoba ufulu amofea alefasia, gilihe E hamesebuba walelu amoneda, E asigi galilale. Aufia, gilihe ili sagoba ofolabia, dedalebasu labe amone, Ehe amoda asigi galilale.<verse eid="HEB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Nini hamesia, gili elebi elebibahe, mana amone helegeba mololabia dedaleba melesi hamefe. Auba molosimo, elebe gilihe diyobasuba <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofelagofia yasiba</char> labe amo, gilihe amo seale diyobafeba asigifia miliyobafe. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Gilimo habalomabiyo. Aubale. Idele inolo noolohe, ine asigi ule ofelesia, higinilu disia, hamedofa adabia dedaleba labe. Ili amohe, daalo diyobafeba oloba huliale saaba ufulu amo, diaba yaeyobafe. Inolo amone mimisililu kuliba abia, hamagulu melale.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe oloba huliale saaba ufulumo ofalu dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:16-17">Stt 22.16-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Samini Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamafea</char> sulu saaba ofelesiamo, E <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiiba solu</char>.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gode </char><char style="fq" closed="false">aiiba selese</char><char style="ft" closed="false">naga, sulu E saaba ufulu amo, ofalu miliyobafe.</char></note> Gode E sunialumo, uleno male koleba. Aulune, aiiba saeyone wi no maleba asigisia, E Abalahamafea saaba ofelesia, aiiba selesiamo, <char style="qt">Ene wifea koleba saaba aiilu.</char> <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" /><char style="qt">E auba aiisia, selesia, Na seale gafea koleba <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba ofelesia</char>, ge gauwadalimo wedinale meyobasu koleba.</char> <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Auba selesi, Abalahama e, hamedofa yasilabia daaba labeofia, oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulu amo ami dulu.<verse eid="HEB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Helefealu idele inolo, ilihe sulu saaba ofelesiamo, ine sulu amo kiwigaaba ufiyonemo, ilida sunialu inolo amone wi alefasia <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiiba</char> sodo. Aiilu sulu amohe, sulu saaba ufulumo kiwigaaba ofelesia, oloba koweyone sulu amo elosia aufe. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Gode Ehe moloyoba saaba ofelesiamo, sulu E solu amo, saaba ofalu dobu koleba. Ehe Abalahamafea sulu saaba ofelesia, ene enauwadali daalo kegele diyobafeba solu. Sulu saaba ufulu amo, seale alefalu sulune, moloyobafeba hilisemesifia, Ehe aiiba selesia, gaduba solu.<verse eid="HEB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 23:19">Nam 23.19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godehe masega gegeba sodale. Nini auba asigibu. Aulune, ofalu kegele aida amofea alefasia, Godehe nini kiwigaaba ofolefe. Kegele nomo, Ehe moloyobafeba oloba huliale saaba ufulu amo. Kegele nomo, Ehe sulu amo gaduba selesia, Ene wifea aiiba solu amo. Ofalu kegele aida amofea alefasia, kiwigaaba ofelesia, nini E labea fisaba daafia, daalo amo diyoba, <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasifia</char> lolu. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2-3">Wkp 16.2-3</ref></char></note>Hameda diba ofogofia yasiba lolu idele inolo nini amo, i kolegida nolobalo ami dafogofia labi, gaoofia adoguba adefe. Auba gaoofia labimo, nine <char style="w">asigine libo</char> asubaiyobafale koleba. I kolegi ewemo diba ofalagosi, abia, Lalolu Maleelu Noekene<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lalolu Maleelu Noekene</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefe amo, Godene Seele Molo usu amone selefe. Seele molo usu ami, fagulo uleno helefia labe. Helefia labe amo molo lalolu aida amone elalobu. Lalolu nomo, Lalolu Nokene labe. Nomo, Maleelu Nokene labe. Fagulo amone faisalo ami, idele inolo balu anale. Aubale. Soba melone guni inolo, ene e galagololu alefasia, e-su ami sugalo.</char></note> usu ami sugasia, fagulo helebu amone faisalo ami, kolegisi, gaoofia labe. <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />Nini suniane sagoba ofelesia, Yesu Edale saminiba, fagulo elalolu helebia ami sugalu. Maumo, E <char style="w" lemma="Melekisedeke">Melekisedekene</char> eno kuliba inigia mulumo, E <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">Soba Melone Guni Inolo</char> alefalu labe.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Melekisedeke e Godefea soba melo inolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 14:17-20">Stt 14.17-20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w">Melekisedeke</char> ewe, hele Salemene kini. Aufia, sunia sunialu Gode amone <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char>, e labe. <char style="w">Abalahama</char> e-mo, kini noolodai belagulumo kaamo alefasia, obegeba labi, Melekisedeke ehe e wakalisia, efea <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba ufulu</char>.<verse eid="HEB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />Aufia, Abalahamahe belagufia kegele sunia dulumo, osolafia, daabulu ulenomo Melekisedekefea melu. Melekisedekeba wi selefemone sisamo ewe, “mana isolu koleba amone kini”. Aufia Salemene kiniba selefe amone sisamo ewe, “<char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealone</char> kini”.<verse eid="HEB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Melekisedeke e enae enaoda male.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:3">Aufia, e ene enauwane saladegelu amoda male.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:3">Aufia, e seba dulu hiliada male.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:3">Aufia, e olalu hilia amoda male.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:3">E Godene faibegulu ligia,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:3">e soba melo inolo alefalu labe.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Melekisedeke e koleba, ana wi bule dulu alolumo, gili amo asigima. Nine nauwa maugaba alolumo Abalahama, eda Melekisedeke wida aloluba walelu. Enebamo, e kaamo adesia, kegele dulu amo osolafia, daabulu ulenomo Melekisedekefea melu. Auba melu amo alefasia, Abalahama walesia, Melekisedeke ehe e-mo wasoluba walelu.<verse eid="HEB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 18:21">Nam 18.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fogo aalu auba moloiya ami, Lifai aso male alolu. Aufia dufia, Lifai e Abalahamane saladegelufia holobagalu. Mosesehe elo ufulumo kuliba abia, Lifai mosomu aleba ami, inolo noolomo soba melo melesi gadefalu. Soba meyone auba iminilu ili amohe, ine elebemo ine elewodalimofeafia daabulu mesi dilo. Ine elewodalimo, ilida Abalahamane saladegelu ligiaso, ilihe ine elewo Lifaifea daabulu melo alolu.<verse eid="HEB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Melekisedeke e-mo, Lifai mosomuale. Auluso, ehe Abalahamafeafia daabulu kegele dulu. Aulune, nini asigisia, Melekisedeke e Abalahama wasoluba asigisu. Aufia, Abalahamamo, e Godene saaba ufulu sulu dulu labi, Melekisedeke ehe Abalahama amo nafulu mesesi ediliba ufulu. Aulune, nini asigisia, Melekisedeke ewemo, anane ana koleba labe. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Enebamo, idele inolo sunia eweguba asigibu. Inolo abehe inolo nofea ediliba ofa selefe amo, e inolo bule koleba labe. Aufia, ehe ediliba saaba ofelesi, edililo dife inolo amo e sisa labe. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Lifai mosomu ilihe, Isolaelene daabulu kegele haisi dilo, ili amo olalo inolo alebaibu. Auluso, Melekisedekehe Abalahamane daabulu haisi dulu amo, bebea labe. Godene bugo auba selelu dobiyo. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9-10" />Nini alefasia, eweguba saeyo dobu. Daabulu kegele dilo mosomu Lifai amo, ilihe ine daabulu kegele Melekisedekefea melu. Maumo, Melekisedekehe Abalahama wakaliya fogo amimo, Lifai e-mo ene enauwane ibifea aso labi, aulu. Aulugulu, Abalahamahe daabulu mesimo, Lifai e ene ibifea ligia, eda Melekisedekefea daabulu melu.<verse eid="HEB 7:9-10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E Melekisedeke hamagulu labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Saminimo, Godehe Isolaele idele inolofea molomalelu sulu saaba ufulu. Auba molomalesiamo, Lifai ili soba meyone dabalu ami molomesiba, elo saaba ufulu. Dabalu Lifai ili molofe amohe, wolu heeyomo sunia ililiba samodolubiaga, <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> hili no miyomo alebaiyale. Auluso, inolo hili mulu amo, <char style="w" lemma="Alono">Alonone</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Inolo </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Alono </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo, Lifai mosomu inolo. E soba melone guni inolo maugaba alolu.</char></note> saladegelufia muluale. Aubale. <char style="w">Melekisedeke</char> muluguba, eno amo kuliba inigia, inolo hili holobagalu. <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Aulugulu, Melekisedeke soba melone eno holobagasia, Alono soba melone eno alibiasenaga, amo molomalelu sulu samini ufulu amoda alibiayobafe.<verse eid="HEB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13-14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.13-14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:1">Ais 11.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 2:6">Mad 2.6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:5">MUU 5.5</ref></char>
    </note>Soba melo inolo Melekisedekene eno amo kuliba inigia, holobagaluba selesu amo, nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu E. E Lifai mosomufia holobagaluale. Aubale. E Yuda mosomufia mulu. Auluso, Yuda mosomu ilihe soba melone dabalu mololale. Maumo, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesehe</char> molomalelu sulu ofelesiamo, Yuda ili soba meyone dabalu ami molomesiba elo saaba ufuluale. <verse eid="HEB 7:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Aulune, Lifai mosomune molomalelu sulu ufulu amo kuliba abiamo, Yuda mosomu inolo Yesuhe, E soba meyone dabalu moloyodoluale. Auluso, aga Melekisedekene eno kuliba inigiamo, Yesuhe soba melone dabalu molofe. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />E dabalu amo dulumo, mosomu amofea alefasia diyone sulu solumo, kuliba abia duluale. Aubale. Ene miliyolu amone kiwigagalu alefasia, Yesuhe dabalu amo dulu. Ene miliyolumo woba dafolale. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Sng 110.4</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 5:6">Hib 5.6</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Godene bugo Efea selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 7:17" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:17">
    <char style="qt">Ga-mo, Melekisedekene eno kuliba inigia mulumo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:17">
    <char style="qt">Ga soba melo inolo alefalu labe.</char><verse eid="HEB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Sulu ewe ninifea eweguba walefe. Godehe molomalelu sulu samini ufulumo, diba dafelesia afolu. Maumo, sulu amo ele male, kiwidale adesia, nini sagoba ufiyodoluale alolu. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:22">Hib 10.22</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:8">Yem 4.8</ref></char></note><char style="w">Muguli</char> mana alefasia, inolo ulenofeada, kegele ulenofeada, nafulu moloba dafelagolualebiyo. Ausi, Godehe eno no sogoba ufulu. Amo alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame ninida aga diba ofolagofia yasisu</char> amo, nafulu koleba ligia, hame nooloda wasolu dobu. Amo alefasia, nini Gode aniba hagoaleba miliyo maiyodolu dobu.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Aufia, Godehe eno amo sogoba ofelesia, Ehe ene sulu kiwigaaba ofelesia <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiilu</char>. Yesu E soba melo inolo melesi aiifia gadefalu. Auluso, E Lifai inolo soba melo inolo melesi gadefasiamo, E auba aiiluale. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Sng 110.4</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 5:6">Hib 5.6</ref></char></note>Auluso, Gode E <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiisi</char>, Yesuhe soba melone dabalu dulu. Godene bugo selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 7:21" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">
    <char style="qt">“Saminilo E koleba eweguba aiiba solu.</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 7:21" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">
    <char style="qt">‘Ga-mo, soba melo inolo alefalu labe.’</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 7:21" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">
    <char style="qt">Ene aiiba sulu solu amo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">
    <char style="qt">E ulumaluda malene obegeyobafale koleba.”</char><verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 8:6">Hib 8.6</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:24">12.24</ref></char>
    </note>Aga Godehe ninidai <char style="w">oloba huliale dabalu</char> hili nafulu yogolelu moloba ufulu. Dabalu hili ewehe, dabalu amakelelu mololumo wasolu. Godene aiiba sulu solu amo alefasia, Yesu E-mo sealeba moloba dafelagosia walelu.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Lifai inolo ilimo, olalo inolo alebaibu. Aulugulu, inolo wedinale soba melo dabalu moloba yaalu. Maumo, olalohe ili kaasi, ili soba meyone dabalumo molobasu adale. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Auluso, Yesu E alefalu bebea labe. E soba melo dabalu molosia, alefalu moloba labe. Aufia, Eda alibiaba miliyone inolo no male. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:34">Lom 8.34</ref></char></note>Aulune, idele inolo Ene wifea alefasia, Gode labea hagoale saabemo, Ehe ine miliyolu <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba disia</char>, moloba samodolo. Mau enebamo, E alefalu bebea labe amo alefasia, E hilia sunia olea ligia, Godehe idele inolo uluba melesi, Efea sulu selabasu ado.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Soba melo guni inolo amogulumo, ninidai <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> koleba labe. Enebamo, E <char style="w">Noekene</char> labe. Aufia, Efea heleba daaluda male. Aufia, E Godene si saabiamo galagololu labe. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu mololo</char> idele inolo aleba ami adesiale, <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi ana ofolagolu labe. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:3">Hib 5.3</ref></char></note>Yesu E-mo, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> noolo amoguluale. Enebamo, ilihe hilia ule uleba, maugabamo ine wolumodale diba damesisia, soba melo. Aufasia, ilihe idele inolone <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolumo</char> heeba damesisia, ulu soba melo. Auluso, Yesuhe dabalu auba mololale. Aubale. Ehe idele inolone wolumo heeba damesisia, Godefea soba mesiamo, Ehe fogo ule hamagisu, Ene meleba Godefea ulu soba melu.<verse eid="HEB 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Mosese molomalelu sulu ufulu amofea alefasia, kiwi sanelu inolomo, soba melone guni inolo melesi gadefaba ado. Auluso, molomalelu sulu amo ofasia labi, aiiba sulu Gode dufia solu amohe, Ene Faibemo Soba Melone Guni Inolo melesi gadefalu. E kiwi saneluale. Aubale. E ililiba moloba samodolu alefalu ligia, soba meyone dabalu moloyone muuba kalilu koleba ilililu labe.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Yesu hebene usu Soba Melone Guni Inolone dabalu moloba labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Sulu nini lagi solu ewenemo, sulu kiwi olaibomo eweguba. Yesu E nine <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">Soba Melone Guni Inolo</char> nafulu labe. E <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi, Kini Olaibone asefalu ailaiya inaloafealo ami yoba sabe. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Aufia, E hebene lagi, Godene Molo <char style="w">Noekene</char> usu, dabalu molofe. Molo amo, Godene Gulugululo <char style="w">Seele Molo</char> seale labe. Inolohe molo amo duluale. Aubale. <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Ene dulu. <verse eid="HEB 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Soba melone guni inolo suniahe, Godefea ulu kegeleda soba meyone dia ano. Aulugulu, Soba Melone Guni Inolo Yesu Eda, ulu meyone kegele sefia mulu. Ehe ene meleba ulu melu.<verse eid="HEB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Yesu E hebene lagi, Soba Melone Guni Inolo labe. E helefealu iwi ligiabiaga, amo E soba melo alebaiyale. Mau enebamo, <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> ili ama iwi alebaibu. Aufia, Yudane <char style="w">muguli</char> saaba ufuluguba, ilihe ulu kegele nonoba Godefea melo. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:17">Kol 2.17</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 9:23">Hib 9.23</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:40">Kis 25.40</ref></char></note>Gulugululo molo ilida helefealu iwi soba melo dabalu moloba alebaibu amo, gulugululo molo seale <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi labe, amone mimisililu dedeba moloba labe. <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesehe</char> gulugululo molomo seele diyo molosi, Godehe efea eweguba solu. “<char style="qt">Ga galea labimo, Nahe gafea guluguluyone molo dimesi mimisililu walelu. Ga koleba molo disia, kegele sunia amogubasu molomale.</char>”<verse eid="HEB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 7:22">Hib 7.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulune, agamo, Yesuhe soba melo dabalu molofe amohe, soba melo dabalu ili noolo mololo amo wasolu. Mau enebamo, E olea inolo ligia, idele inolomo Godedai helegeba melesine eno hili sogolu. Eno hili amohe, eno amakelelu anomo wasolu dobu. Enebamo, eno hagaea amone aiba abiamo, nini Godene <char style="w" lemma="Oloba huliale dabalu">oloba huliale</char> saaba ufuluiya ami goayobafe. Oloba huliale saaba ufulu amohe, samini saaba ufulu amo sunialu. <figure style="fig" alt="Tabernacle" file="C034.JPG" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention. Used with permission." ref="8.5">Godefea guluguluyone seele molo</figure><verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oloba huliale dabalu hili amohe, oloba huliale dabalu maugaba ufulumo wasolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Enebamo, oloba huliale dabalu maugaba mololu ewe, nafulu koleba alolubiaga, amo oloba huliale dabalu hili no, Gode moloyone eno isaba alebaiyale. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.8-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31.31-34</ref></char></note>Auluso, Godehe idele inolo heleba mololu amo baafia, ilidai <char style="w">oloba huliale dabalu</char> hili mololu. Godene bugo amo iminisia, eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 8:8" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">
    <char style="qt">“Saminilo selesia,</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 8:8" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">
    <char style="qt">‘Doma! Na alefasia, hilia uleno iminiba ufulumo holobagaeyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">
    <char style="qt">Hilia amo, Nahe <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomuda, Yuda mosomuda, ilidai oloba huliale dabalu hili moloyo.</char><verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />
    <char style="qt">Oloba huliale dabalu Na moloyobasu ewemo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">
    <char style="qt">oloba huliale dabalu samini ine enauwadali ilidai mololu amoguluale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">
    <char style="qt">Nahe ilifea oloba huliale dabalu samini molosiamo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">
    <char style="qt">Nahe ine sone gasiba disiamo, ili Isibi hele gadefia luba dibia holobagafia daalu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">
    <char style="qt">Auluso, Isolaele idele inolo ilihe Ne oloba huliale dabalu mololumo, fedoba sefia kuliba aasale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">
    <char style="qt">Ausi, Nahe ili golaba abulu.’</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 8:9" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">
    <char style="qt">Saminilo auba solu.</char><verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />
    <char style="qt">Aufia, Saminilo saabia selesia,</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 8:10" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">
    <char style="qt">‘Dufia, Nahe oloba huliale dabalu hili Isolaele idele inolodai moloyobasu. Amo eweguba.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">
    <char style="qt">Nahe Ne sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> ufulumo sunia ine asigifea diba ofelesia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">
    <char style="qt">Nahe Ne sulumo ine libofeada seleba ufiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, Na-mo ine Gode adesia, ilimo Ne mosomu idele inolo koleba miliyobafe.</char><verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />
    <char style="qt">Ausi, fogo amoyamo, idele inolo suniahe Na asigiba samodoyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">
    <char style="qt">Aulune, inolohe ene damenedalifeada, ene elewodalifeada,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">
    <char style="qt">haiba saabia no eweguba saabale miliyobafe. “Gili Saminilo asigima.”</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">
    <char style="qt">Mau enebamo, idele inolo wedinofia, abia buleda, ili sunia Na asigiba samodoyobafe.</char><verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />
    <char style="qt">Ausi, Nahe ili kanulusia, ine libo nugumalumo heesia galiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:12">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, Nahe ine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolumo</char> saabia hiliseba obegeyale.’ ”</char><verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Sulu ewemo, Godehe oloba huliale dabalu hili mololu amone selefe. Sulu amo walesiamo, oloba huliale dabalu samini mololumo, ama amakelelu alolu dobu. Hili amohe amakelelumone fogo disi, ene dabalu saabia no moloyo male. Kegele uleno amakelelu adesia, ene dabalu malene, alebale asigilelo. Aulugulu, oloba huliale dabalu samini mololumo, amoda asigileyobafe.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Helefealu Seele Molo Noekene amone gulugululo mana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:23-26:30">Kis 25.23–26.30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Oloba huliale dabalu maugaba mololu ewehe, gulugulusia moloyone molomaleba solu sulu noolo ufulu. Aufia, gulugululo molo <char style="w" lemma="Noekene">noekene</char> helefealu iwi alolu. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Ilihe <char style="w">seele molo</char> diba ufulu. Molo amimo, aidaba hogolilu. Hogolilu miafealo elaloiya ami, gamali yaaba ofolo ida, ailaluda dobu. Ailalu saabia ami, <char style="w">boledi</char> nolugulumo Godene olegia ufulu dobu. Hogolilu ewemo, “Maleelu Hogoliluba” sodo. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Kis 26.31-33</ref></char></note>Seele molo usu amimo, fagulo ami diba helelu. Aufia, fagulo amone faisamo, hogolilu aganebo ufulu. Aufia, hogolilu elalolu amomo, “Maleelu Noekene Hogoliluba” sodo.<verse eid="HEB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 16:33">Kis 16.33</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 25:10-16">25.10-16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 30:1-6">30.1-6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 17:8-11">Nam 17.8-11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 10:3-5">Lo 10.3-5</ref></char>
    </note> Maleelu Noekene Hogolilu amimo, kegele noolo ami ufulu. Kasineda nafulu holobagamesi soba melo ailalu ami ufulu. Ailalu amomo, <char style="w" lemma="Golo">golohe</char> nolobaloda, nolobaloda, gasiaguba ufulu. Aufia, oloba huliale dabalu mololo amone bogose amoda ami ufulu. Bogose amomo, golo gasiaguba samodolu ufulu. Aufia, bogose usu ami, gofo golo mololu seba ufulu. Gofo amofea <char style="sls"><char style="w">mena</char></char> seba ufulu. Aufia, bogose usu ami, <char style="w" lemma="Alono">Alonone</char> kaidamo amoda seba ufulu. Kaidamo amo, samini kau gaalu amone. Aufia, abane balele aida amoda ami seba ufulu. Godehe oloba huliale dabalu moloyoneda balele aida amofea seleba ufulubiyo. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:18-22">Kis 25.18-22</ref></char></note>Bogose ewene dofoga saabiamo, Godene sulu dia ano amone mimisililu aida mololumo labe. Sulu dia ano amogulune wimo, <char style="it"><char style="w">kelubimi</char></char>ba sodo. Aalu Godene <char style="w">elalelu</char> amone iminisia, aine awi aidamo dalagafia ligia, dofoga amo gasiagufia labe. Aine awi auba gasiagufia labea ami, idele inolo Godedai seloaba ofolaba ada fogo ami labe. Agamo, ninihe kegele ewene haisi haisiba, gagalaba fadaba saeyalebu.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 18:2-6">Nam 18.2-6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kegele amo sunia auba moloba waalefia labi, soba melo ilimo, hilia sunia seele molo usu hugafia, miafealo hogolilu ami, ine soba melo dabalu moloba ado. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 16:2-34">Wkp 16.2-34</ref></char></note>Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ehe, hamu sunia ule uleba, hilia ulehe, sosafealo hogolilu usu ami sugalo. Kelebulu ibida sebale hogolilu ami sugalale. Aubale. Ehe kelebulu ibida sefia sugalo. Ibi ulu mefe amohe, ene woluda heeba dafelesia, aufia idele inolone wolu ili molosuba hilisebale mololu amoda, heeba damesi mololo. <figure style="fig" alt="Ark of the Covenant, cherubim" file="02_Ex_25_04_RG.jpg" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence" ref="9.4-5">Bogosene dofoga saabia, Godene sulu dia anone mimisilu aida labe.</figure><verse eid="HEB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Auba moloba alolu amo alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane</char> ninifea walelumo ewe. Gulugululo molo agele amo aso labimo, Gode labea ami, nini suga maiyomo eno amo aso sogoba ufuluale. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:1-2">Hib 10.1-2</ref></char></note>Seele molo ewemo ninifea aga fogo ewe mimisililu balu walefe. Seele molo amimo, ilihe Godefea ulu nonoba mesia, soba melo. Auluso, kegele amo suniahe, gulugulufe inolo ili amone <char style="w" lemma="Asigi nafulune si">asigine si</char> amo, isolu galagololu melesi sagoba ofolale.<verse eid="HEB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Mosesene muguli sulu amohe, naiyo naiyone manada, hano naiyone manada, <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">nuguma heeyone</char> mana nonoba amoda, auba molomaleba sodo. Auluso, mana sunia amomo, bado saabiane kegele amone moloyonesu ufulu. Mana amone dabalu amo aso ufiasu ligia, Godehe eno hili no sogosi, afolu.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelisohe Ene ibi ulu melu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Keliso E-mo Ulu Soba Meyone Guni Inolo holobagaiya ami, eno nafulu amo sogolu. Yesuhe dabalu amo moloyonemo, E Godene <char style="w">Seele Molo</char> elalelu Hebene labea ami, faseba suga daalu. Seele Molo Yesuda faseba sugalu amo, inolo sone mololualegulu, helefealu iwi mololu kegele amoneale. Aubale. Seele Molo amomo, ililiba isoba diba samodolu ligia, seele molo samini dulu alolu amo, wasolu koleba labe. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Keliso E Seele Molo Maleelu <char style="w">Noekene</char> ami sugasiamo, dofene keao edone ibidai, memene ibidai, dibia sugaluale. Aubale. Ehe fogo ule hamagi, Ene ibi koleba dibia sugalu. Aufia, Ene ibi mesiamo, nine wolu mololu amone su suluba mesia, nini sububa dafogolu. Haiba saabia no suluba meyalene, ule amosu moloba kaasia, alefalumone suluba melu dobu.<verse eid="HEB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 16:15-16">Wkp 16.15-16</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 19:9">Nam 19.9</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 19:17-19">17-19</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:4">Hib 10.4</ref></char>
    </note>Mana samini moloba ada ami, idele inolo Godene si saabia nuguma baasenaga, amo <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melo inolohe</char>, dofene memene ibida, dofene keao dofolone ibida, aufia dofene keao edobeyo de soba dagilu amone keda, difasia, idele inolofea gasaliba dowelo. Ili auba molofemo, idele inolo Godene si saabia galagololu isolu melesisia mololo. Ili auba mololo amo, bado saabianesu galagololu moloba ofolo.<verse eid="HEB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 1:18-19">1Fid 1.18-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> ibihe, kelebulune ibi ewe wasolu labe koleba. Enebamo, Keliso Efea heleba daalu ulenoda male koleba. Asubane <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> labe amone kiwigagalu amofea alefasia, Ehe Ene meleba Godefea ulu melu. Ausia, Ehe nine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi nafulune si">asigine si</char> nuguma heelu. Ausi, ninida olalofealo lubia abia daaba adomo afelesia, ninimo Gode miliyoluda labe amone dabalu seale koleba moloyobasu.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesune ibihe oloba huliale dabalu hili mololu amone kiwigaaba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />
    <char style="w">Oloba huliale dabalu</char> hili mololu amone, ninidai Godedai aleba olea inolomo, Yesu E labe. Amone mau ewe. Dabalu agele mololu amo aso dobimo, idele inolo ilihe molobale afelesia, heleba dedalelu. Heleba dedalelu amone su suluba mesia, Yesu olalu. Ausi, idele inolo Gode welumo dofasia, kuliba aafe ili amo, daalo alefalu diyobafe. Godehe ilifea auba meyobafeba sulu saaba ufulu.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Inolo e olaeyoba asigisiamo, ehe ene daalo halaguba osolaeyobiba asigilo. Aufia, e oloba huliale sulu saaba ofolo. Aufia, inolo amo olasi, ene daalo amo oloba huliale saaba ufulu sulu amone kuliba abia, ene faibilifea osolaba ofolo. Auluso, enao aso olaluale koleba labimo, faibilihe ene daalo amo balu osolaba dilale. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Maumo, inolo amo olafe fogo amisumo, oloba huliale saaba ufulu sulu amo kiwida adesia, amone moloyomo dabalu dobu. Auluso, inolo aso bebea labimo, oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulumo aso kiwidale labene, amone moloyomo dabalu aso male. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Aulugulu, nini bisigia, inolo olabale labi, oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulumo kiwidale ligia, dabalu male ado. Amogubasu, Godehe idele inolodai, oloba huliale dabalu mololu amofea kiwigaaba ofelesia, dabalu molomesi, uleno olaeyo dobu. Aulune, kelebulu dufa olasia, ine ibihe, oloba huliale dabalu agele mololumo, kiwigaaba ofolo.<verse eid="HEB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Kis 24.6-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Saminimo, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesehe</char> sulu <char style="w" lemma="Muguli">mugulimo</char> sunia, idele inolo suniafea saaba melu. Auba saaba mefasia, ehe dofene keao edone ibida, dofene memene ibida, difasia, hanodai besilu. Aufia, dofene sibine alu genelu wedideno difasia, hisobo aagofea dofafia, ibi besilu amofea gelu. Aufia, ehe muguli sulu selelu bugo amofeadale gasaliba dowefasia, aufia, idele inolo suniafea gasaliba dowelu. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Mosese auba gasaliba dowesia, selesia, “<char style="qt">Ibi ewemo, oloba huliale dabalu mololu ewene ibi. Godehe molomalelu sulu ninifea saaba melu amone kiwigaaba ofelesia, nahe ibi ewe gilifea gasaliba dowesu.</char>” <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Wkp 8.15</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 8:19">19</ref></char></note>Mana hamagubasu, Mosesehe ibi amo difasia, <char style="w">seele molo</char> gulugululo amofea gasaliba dowefasia, kegele sunia ili gulugulusia dilo amofeada gasaliba dowelu. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:11">Wkp 17.11</ref></char></note>Seale nini asigibu. Mosesene muguli mana alefasia, kegele sunia ibifea alefasia galagololu holobagalo. Aulugulu, ibi sagasalenaga, Gode alefasia, idele inolone wolu mololumo heesia galilale.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Keliso Ene meleba ulu melumo, wolu diba dafiyone mololu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 8:5">Hib 8.5</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:1">10.1</ref></char>
    </note>Seele molo gulugulusia mololo kegele amo, kegele <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi dobu amone mimisililu waalebu. Helefealu iwi, ilihe kelebulune ibi difasia, mimisililu amo Godene si saabia galagololu melesi moloba ufulu. Auluso, kegele seale hebene lagi dobu amomo, kelebulune ibihe heeba ofolale. Aubale. Hebene kegele amo ibi nafulu nohe, kelebulune ibi wasolu amo alefasia, galagololu gadefalu. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Maumo, nini asigibu, seele molo gulugululo helefealu iwi labe amomo, seele molo seale hebene lagi labe amone mimisililu alolu. Auluso, Keliso E hebene lagi, seale molo, inolo sone mololuale ami suga daalu. Aga E ami Godene olegia yoba sigia, nini sagoba ofa dabalu moloba labe.<verse eid="HEB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Helefealu iwi, hamu sunia ule uleba, saabia saabiaba, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolohe</char>, ibi difasia, Maleelu <char style="w">Noekene</char> Hogolilu ami sugalu. Ibi e difasia sugalu amo, ene ibiale koleba. Auluso, Yesu E auba saabia saabiaba hebene sugabale, E fogo ule hamagi, Ene meleba Godefea ulu mesia sugalu. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:10">Hib 10.10</ref></char></note> Ehe fogo wedinale auba moloba ligiabiaga, amo E helefealu maugaiya amifia inigia, aga iwida, fogo wedinale naga auba diabia dabaiyo. Auluso, auba auluale. Keliso Ehe Ene meleba ulu meyone hebene sugasi, aleba eloyo fogomo ami maugalu. E auba molosia, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> sunia heeba dafulu. Haiba saabia no moloyalene, fogo ule ami mololu. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Idele inolo sunia fogo uluse hamagi olaeyobafe. Auba olafia, dufia fadaayo dobia ami, kalugaeyobafe. <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />Aubasu, fogo uluse hamagi, Keliso Ene E-mo, Godefea ulu melu. Amofea alefasia, Ehe idele inolo wedinale amone wolu diba dafalilu. Wolu sunia auba diba dafalifasia, dufia E aganebo miyobafemo, wolu diba dafiyone dabalu no male miliyobafale. Aubale. E miyobafemo, idele inolo E yasifia labe amone sunia <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> obegeba diyone miyobafe.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="s">Samini ulu soba meba ado amomo wolu seale heelale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Nini Mosesene sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> amo bisigiamo, kegele nafulu dufia holobagaeyobafe amone, waagi mimisiliba bosolu. Asigima. Nini molo usu yoba sigia, inolo no aso goayo labi, ene asubane mimisililu amodale goasi bologuba, nini dufia holobagafe amone mimisililu dedeba bosolu. Auluso, holobagafe amone ele sealemo, nini aso bosoluale. Aulune, eweguba labe. Idele inolo muguli sisa ligia, Gode labea aasusia, ili wolu mololu heemesimo, hamu sunia, kelebulune ibimo Godefea saabia saabiaba ulu soba meba alolu. Auluso, kelebulune ibi melabia daaba labe amohe, ili galagololu nafulu koleba gadefalale.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Inolone asubane mimisililu amohe dabalu seale mololaleguba, mana amoda dabalu seale mololale. Aubale. Inolo ele ene holobagafe amo, e seale dabalu mololo. Aulugulu, Yesu Keliso, inolo ele sealemo, E labe.</char></note> <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Ulu soba meba ado mana amohe, idele inolo nafulu koleba holobagamesi moloba ufulubiaga, amo ilihe ulu haiba saabia no soba mebaiyalebiyo. Aufia, ulu soba mefe amohe, idele inolo guluguluyo saabemo ule hamaga galagololu moloba ofelesiabiaga, amo ine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> auba heefia labi, ilihe wolu mololu amone haiba saabia no hilisebaiyale. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3-4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.3-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:13">Hib 9.13</ref></char></note>Auluso, auluale. Dofene keao dofolone ibidai, memene ibidai, amohe wolu heeba dafolale koleba. Auba aulugulu, hamu sunia ami, ine wolumo heemesi-sia, kelebulu ibi meba alolugulu, ilihe auba moloba ligiamo, ine wolu haiba asigiba obegeba alolu.<verse eid="HEB 10:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.5-7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Sng 40.6-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, Keliso helefealu iwi inigiamo, E Godefea eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 10:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">
    <char style="qt">“Ilihe kelebulu dufasia, soba mefe amo, Ga dibaiyeba hilisesale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">
    <char style="qt">Auluso, Gahe domala ule Nafea meyone madeneba ufulu dobu.</char><verse eid="HEB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />
    <char style="qt">Aufia, ilihe kelebulu ulu mesia, de sunia soba dagiba yaafe amoda,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:6">
    <char style="qt">aufia wolu heemesi soba meba yaafe amoda, Ga dibaiyesia hamesale koleba.</char><verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />
    <char style="qt">Aulune, aga Na selesia, ‘Gode-ooo, na lolu ewe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">
    <char style="qt">Samini, ilihe Na auba moloyobafebamo bugo usu saaba ofelesia seleba ufulu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">
    <char style="qt">Aga Na Ge hame kuliba maiyone mulu.’ ”</char><verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Auba selesiamo, Ene sulu haisi agelemo, Yesuhe Godefea eweguba solu. “<char style="qt">Ili ulu soba mefe amoda, kelebulu dufasia, sunia soba dagiba soba mefe amoda, aufia ine wolu heeba damesi ulu soba mefe amoda, Ga amo sunia dibaiyeba hilisesale. Aufia, Ga amo dibaiyesia hamesale.</char>” Yesu auba solu. Auluso, muguli suluhe auba ulu soba memaleba selesi, kuliba abia, ilihe ulu soba mebasu ado. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Haisi agele auba safasia, Yesuhe sulu haisi aganebo eweguba solu. “<char style="qt">Aga Na lolu ewe, Ge hame kuliba maiyone mulu.</char>” Auba selesihe, Godehe eno agelemo afelesia, idele inolo ine wolu heeyone eno hili no sogolu. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:12">Hib 9.12</ref></char></note>Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisohe</char> Godene hame kuliba abia, Ene domala amo Godefea ulu melu. E auba fogo uluse hamagi ami mololu amo alefasia, nini aga Godedai <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu melesi moloba ofolo">muuba kalilu idele inolo moloba ufulu</char> lolu.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Keliso ulu melu amohe wolu isoba heeba dafulu koleba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 29:38">Kis 29.38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hilia sunia, ulu <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> ili sunia guluguluyone dabalu molobasu ado. Ilihe ule hamagulusu, saabia saabiaba soba mebasu ado. Auluso, mana amohe, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> diba dafalilale koleba.<figure style="fig" alt="Priest offers sacrifice" file="C036.JPG" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention. Used with permission." ref="10.11">Soba melo inolohe Godefea ulu soba mefe.</figure> <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Auluso, Kelisohe ulu ule soba melu hamagahe, wolu diba dafulu koleba. Aufia, E auba ulu soba melu ule amosuhe, dabalu amo adabia daabasu miliyobafe. E auba moloba samodofia, Godene sone ililibefealo yoba saabe. <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sng 110.1</ref></char></note>Ami yoba sigia, Godehe Ene gisamo sunia Ene emo sisa diba homesi, E amone yasifia labe.<verse eid="HEB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Ehe ulu ule soba melu hamaga alefasia, Godedai <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> adefe idele inolo ili amo, ililiba isoba koleba moloba ufulu alebaibu. Ili amo auba adabia daabasu miliyobafe. <verse eid="HEB 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Godene Bugo usu, <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> Eda, sulu amo seale soluba ulufaba ninifea selefe. Maugabamo, Ehe eweguba selefe.<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:33">Jer 31.33</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 8:10">Hib 8.10</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">“Dufia, Nahe <char style="w">oloba huliale dabalu</char> hili ilidai moloyobasu. Amo eweguba.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">
    <char style="qt">Nahe Ne sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> sunia ine asigifea diba ofelesia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">
    <char style="qt">Nahe Ne sulumo ine libofeada seleba ufiyo.”</char><verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:34">Jer 31.34</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Saminilohe sulu gegoaba selesia, eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 10:17" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:17">
    <char style="qt">“Ine wolu nonoba moloba yaalo amoda, sulu muguli faiso meba yaalo amoda,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:17">
    <char style="qt">Na galisia, saabia no hiliseba obegeyale.”</char><verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Aulugulu, Godehe wolu mololumo heesia galiba yaabunaga, amo wolu heemesi ulu soba meyone dabalu moloyo no male.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nini koleba asigi ule ofasia, Gode aniba hagoaleba miliyo maiyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 4:16">Hib 4.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, ne damenedali, Yesune ibi alefasia, nine wolu heeba dafulugulu, nini yuasia sagilisiale, asigi kiwigaafia, Godene moloa ami, Maleelu <char style="w">Noekene</char> Hogolilu ami suga maiyodolu dobu. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:51">Mad 27.51</ref></char></note>Saminimo, Maleelu Noekene Hogolilu Gode labea sugamesialemo, fagulo ami helefia elalo kaaba ofolo. Fagulo helelu amomo, Yesu ene domala amobu. Yesu olasi, fagulo amo gagalaba dafulu. Aulune, nini Gode labea sugaeyomo, eno hili sogoba ufulu dobu. Eno amo miliyoluda labe. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Nine Soba Melone Guni Inolo bule labe. E alefasia, Godene mosomu idele inolo nini sunia luba ado. <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:30">Wkp 8.30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:25">Ese 36.25</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:26">Efe 5.26</ref></char></note>Yesune ibimo nine libofea gasaliba dowesia, na heleba mololuba hilisesia yualo amone heeba dafulu. Aufia, nine domalamo, hano galagololu amohe heeba dafia labe. Ausi, nine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> dobu amohe, nini kiwigaaba ofelesi, nine libohe kegele uleno muguba ofelesiale, nini Gode aniba hagoaleba miliyo maiyone aasu.<verse eid="HEB 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Godehe sulu oloba huliale selesenaga, E afelesiale, auba moloyobafe. Aulune, nini koleba, Ehe ninifea nafulu moloyobafeba <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofolagofia yasiba</char> lolu. Nini auba loluba fogaba saaba dafelagoba lolu. Auba ligia, asigi aida ufiya adesiale, kiwigaaba kalugaeyoba. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Nini elebi elebiba koleba, Godene idele inolo noolo anogo asigiyoba. Aufia, ninihe nine geleba auba selesia, asigi degeba walemale. Noolo hamesesia, mana nafulu molomalesia, nini nine geleba kiwigaaba ofelesia moloyoba. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 3:13">Hib 3.13</ref></char></note>Nini aleba ami, noolohe guluguluyone gagaiyola ami saabia no saabeale. Ninimo, ili afelefeguba afelesiale, milibasu miliyo dobu. Enebamo, gili asigibu, Kelisone hiliamo miyo hagoalefe. Aulugulu, nini elebi elebibahe noolo anogone asigi sagoba ofelesia, kiwigaaba ofa selaba miliyoba.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ninihe Godene Faibefea faiso meyobale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 6:4-8">Hib 6.4-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Doma. Ninihe Kelisone sulu seale sodo amo dawaloba dulu ligiaso, amofea hamasia, nine hame kuliba abia, wolu mana waagi fedoba sefiasu adesenaga, wolu amone heeba dafiyone ulu soba meyomo no male koleba. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:11">Ais 26.11</ref></char></note>Aubale, nini auba molobasu adesenaga, nini Godene gisa adesu. Asigima. Godene gisa ilimo, fadaayo hilia bule miliyobafe amone koleba yasisia, sagiliba miliyo dobu. Enebamo, de waiya halolu koleba amohe, Godene gisa ilimo naba samodoyobafe.<verse eid="HEB 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 17:6">Lo 17.6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19.15</ref></char>
    </note>Asigima. Inolo ulenohe, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesene</char> sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> ufulu amo gelelune fadaafeiyamo, inolo aidabile, me osoloabile, fadaba selesenaga, sulu amone saabia, ilihe inolo amo yagunagasiale dufa olalo. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kis 24.8</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:27-29">1Kld 11.27-29</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:30-32">Mad 12.30-32</ref></char></note>Auba ausenaga, inolo abehe Godene Faibefea asigi ule ofasia, obegeba abia, Yesune wida elasiasenaga, enegulu diyobafebi? Enebamo, <char style="w">oloba huliale dabalu</char> mololu amone ibi amohe, inolo amo Godedai <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu melesi moloba ofolo">muuba kalilu melesi moloba ufuluso</char>, ehe ibi amomo eleda male amogulu gadefafe. Ausia, ehe <char style="w">Kanululo</char> Asubane amofea baaba galiba selefe. Asigima, efea eneba sabe meyobafebi? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:35-36">Lo 32.35-36</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:14">Sng 135.14</ref></char></note> Sulu eweda solu amo, nini asigibu. Amo Gode E.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 10:30" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:30">“<char style="qt">Isoyo mana amo Negulu,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:30">
    <char style="qt">Nene Na sabeyo.</char>”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 10:30" />
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 10:30">Ausi, E saabia selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 10:30" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:30">
    <char style="qt">“<char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> Ene idele inolo ine manamo fadaasia osolaeyobafe.”</char><verse eid="HEB 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Seale koleba, bebea labe Gode Ehe sabeyone uleno seba sugasenaga, amo e-mo bule sagiliyo dobu.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nini koleba asigi ule ufulufea kiwigaafia kalugaeyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Gili koleba, samini Godene yane difasia alolumo hiliseba obegema. Fogo amoyamo, ilihe gilifea higini bule mesi, gili naga wedinale dulu. Auluso, gili gigilisiale kiwigaafia kalugaalu. Amo asigiba obegema. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Fogo ami, hilia noolo adesi, ilihe gili gaidabosia, woba molofia, gilimo idele inolone si saabia yuaba melalelu. Aufia, hilia noolomo gine damenedali noolo higinilu amogubasu disi, ine higinilu amo, gili ilidai ua dulu. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:20">Mad 6.20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:11-12">5.11-12</ref></char></note>Ausi, hilia noolo adesi, gine sigidubulu damene noolo dibolo dafogofia labi, amo gilihe ili yagunagafia, ilifea nafulu moloba ufulu. Aufia, gisa ilihe inigia, gine kegele gilifea sagoba molasimo, gili henefia waagi dimesi gadefalu. Mau enebamo, gili gine kegele nafulu kolebamo aso dobuba hilisesia, waagi afolu. Kegele nafulu aso dobu amohe, sagoba dulu kegele waselesia, ufiasu ligia asigileyobafale. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Aulugulu, gilihe yuasia sagilisiale, gine asigi kiwigagalu amo saidamabiyo. Dufiamo gili elebe amone bule koleba diyobafe.<verse eid="HEB 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Gili koleba kiwi sanefia afelesiale kalugamale. Auba kalugaafia ligia, gilihe Godene hame kuliba maiyobafe. Ausimo, Ehe samini oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulu kegele amo gilifea meyobafe. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:20">Ais 26.20</ref></char></note>Maumo, Godene bugo selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 10:37" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">
    <char style="qt">“Aso wedideno yasima.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">
    <char style="qt">Miyobafe E-mo, galisiale saabe.”</char><verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.38 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 2:3-4">Hab 2.3-4</ref> </char>
    </note> <char style="qt">“Inolo Nafea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesi</char>, Na efea isoluba selesi, e bebea miliyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">
    <char style="qt">Auluso, e gigiliba aasenaga, amo Na efea heneyale.”</char><verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Gigiliba ano mana amohe, woba dafiyofealo luba dilo. Auluso, asigi ule ufulu manahe, idele inolo gasiba dafelagolo. Ninimo, gigiliba ano idele inolo loluale. Aubale. Nini asigi ule ufulu idele inolo lolu.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">
    <char style="bd">Asigi ule ufulu</char> manamone mau ewe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 5:7">2Kld 5.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="bd"><char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">Asigi ule ufulune</char></char> manamo eweguba. Ninihe asigi ule ofelesiamo, kegele nini diyobasuba <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasifemo</char>, nini seale diyoba asigibu. Kegele amo nine si aso besabalenagada, waagima. Ninihe asigi ule ofelesia, kegele amo seale dobuba hilisebu. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Nine nauwadali ine asigi ule ofolabia mulu amone bafasia, Godehe ili henesia, ine mana nafuluba solu.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:1">Stt 1.1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:6">Sng 33.6</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:3">Yon 1.3</ref></char>
    </note>Nini <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> amohe nini hilisebu, Godehe anakiwida, helefealuda molosiamo, Ene sulufea alefasia mololu. Sulu amo, bolale kegele. Aulugulu, kegele sunia nini aga bosolu ewe, bolale kegele amofea alefasia mololu dobu.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amakelelu idele inolo ewe ili Godefea <char style="it">asigi ule ufulu</char></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 4:3-10">Stt 4.3-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">
      <char style="w">Aibele</char>
    </char> e Godefea <char style="bd"><char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char></char> amo alefasia, ehe Efea ulu soba melu. Ausi, e soba melu amohe, Keinine soba melumo wasolu. Aibele e asigi ule ufulu mau amo alefasia, Godehe e ulu soba melumo henelu. Aulugulu, ewe ninifea walesia, Godehe e isolu inoloba solu. Aibele e olaluso, ene asigi ule ufulu amohe, aga aso ninifeamo sulu selaba labe.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">Stt 5.21-24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">Inogohe</char> Efea <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> amofea alefasia, Godehe e olamesiale lubia hebene daalu. “<char style="qt">Idele inolohe e isaluso, ili e abuluale. Mau enebamo, Godehe e lubia daalu.</char>” Inogo aso dibale labimo, idele inolo e saaba selesia, ehe Gode heneba ofelesi, Godehe e heneba besabeoba solu. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" /><char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">Asigi ule ofale</char> ligia, inolo ulenohe Gode heneba ufiyodoluale koleba. Mau enebamo, idele inolo abehe Gode labea miyo ligiamo, Gode E labeba asigi ule ofasiasu miyobafe. Aufia, idele inolo Godeda isafemo, Godehe ili amofea elebe nafulu meyobafeba, ili asigi ule auba ufiyo dobu.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 6:13-7:1">Stt 6.13–7.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">Noa</char> eda, <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> amofea alefasia, Godehe efea hagugulu sulu eweguba saaba melu. Helefealu sunia hano galuba naiyobafeba solu. Amo aso babale ligia, Noa Gode sisa ligia, Ene sulu kuliba abia, asigi ule ufulu amofea alefasia, hano sibi uleno mololu. Aufia, eda, ene eamonoda, ene faibilida, sibi usu sugafia, ili woba dafelesiale, nafulu asulu. Ene asigi ule ufulu amofea alefasia, ehe helefealu idele inolo wolu mololusia, sefia osolaba dafulu. Aufia ene asigi ule ufulu amofea alefasia, ehe isolu mana amone daalo diyo inolo holobagalu.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:1-5">Stt 12.1-5</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="it"><char style="w">Abalahama</char></char> eda, <char style="bd"><char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char></char> amofea alefasia, Godehe e wesimo, e Ene sulu kuliba abia, hele efea mefea ami daalu. E auba abiamo, hele amoguiya aasuba hilisebale ligia, Godefea asigi ule ofasia daalu. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:12">Stt 35.12</ref></char></note>Hele Godehe efea meyoba soiya ami goasiamo, e asigi ule ufulu amofea alefasia, hele ami haiba mulu inologulu ligia, seele molosu asulu. E seele molo asulu amoguba, Aisegeda, <char style="w" lemma="Yekobo">Yekoboda</char>, aaluda auba aselabia daalu. Godehe Abalahamafea daalo meyoba saaba ufulu ule hamagane, aaluda edai ua diyo inolo alolu. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Abalahama e sidi ikau koleluda dulu amo holobagasi babaiyefia, kiwigaafia koleba yasifia alolu. Sidi amone diyone, iwafuloda, diyoda, Gode E-su labe. Sidi amo holobagamesi yasisiamo, Abalahama e seele molosu asulu.<verse eid="HEB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:11-14">Stt 18.11-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21.2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:19">Lom 4.19</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">
      <char style="w">Sela</char>
    </char> eda, Godefea <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char>. Asigi ule ufulu amofea alefasia, Godehe ene ela molo amo sogoba ofelesia, efea faibe seba diyone kiwi melu. E saune ligia, aufia faibe misiyone fogomo suniafasia aloluso, Gode moloyobafeba oloba huliale saaba ufulumo, seale sodoba, e asigi ule ufulugulu, ami faibe asulu. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Stt 15.5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22.17</ref></char></note>Fogo amimo, Abalahama ene domala falalu aloluso, ule efeafiasu enauwa wedinale holobagagalu. Aulugulu, ene enauwadalimo, ili wedinale holobagagafasia, anakiwi lagone sigabi alegaeyo babealoguba alebaibu. Ili hano saiigulu, saludiale holobagagalu alebaibu.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 23:4">Stt 23.4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:15">1Sto 29.15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:12">Sng 39.12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:11">1Fid 2.11</ref></char>
    </note>Idele inolo, nini lagi saaba solu amo, ili sunia helefealu iwi ligiamo, kegele nafulu Godehe meyoba oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulumo, ili duluale. Aubale, ili dibale ligia danelu. Auluso, ili aso Godefea <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulumo</char> ufiasu daaba ligia, danelu. Enebamo, ili aso olabale ligia, kegele nafulu holobagaeyobafe amo, hago ligia, heleso bologuba, abulu. Aufia, ilihe amo diyoba asigisia, henelu. Aulune, ili yuabale eweguba solu. “Nini helefealu iwi fogo bilale misiyo mulu idele inolo ligia, hele aga ninida labea iwi, haiba mulu idele inolo amogulu lolu.” <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Idele inolo sulu auba sodomo, amo ili ine mosomu seale amone isaeyo weiyaafe. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Ausi, ili ine mosomu gadefia mulu amo asigisiabiaga, ili isoba ine helea obegeba daabaiyo. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Auluso, ilihe ine hele amakelelu ami obegeyo hilisebale ligia, hele no, amakelelumo wasefasia, nafulu koleba dobia ami dabaiyeba hiliselu. Hele amo <char style="w">hebene</char>. Idele inolo ili auba <char style="bd">asigi ule ofelesia</char>, Godefea eweguba sodo, “Ga nine Gode.” Auba selesi, Godehe ine sulu auba Efea selefe amofeamo yualale. Aulugulu, Ehe sidi amo ili mesesifia madeneba ufulu.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17-18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.17-18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 21:12">Stt 21.12</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">22.1-14</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">Abalahama</char> e <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> amofea alefasia, Godehe e dedeba besabi, ehe Aisegemo Efea ulu melu. Saminimo, Gode Ehe Abahalamafea eweguba solubiyo. “<char style="qt">Aisege efeasufia, ge gauwadali mosomu holobagaeyobafe.</char>” Abalahama, efea oloba huliale sulu auba saaba ufulumo, fedoba sefia ligia, ehe asigi ule ofelesia, ene faibe ulelu amo Godefea ulu mesia dufa meyone alolu. <verse eid="HEB 11:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:17">Lom 4.17</ref></char></note>E auba meyone ligia, e eweguba hiliselu. Aisege olasenaga, amo hama. Godehe e <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba ifoyodolu</char> labe. Aulugulu, Abalahama ehe ene faibemo olaiyafia obegeba dulu. Auba holobagalu amohe, dufia holobagalu amone iminilu.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 27:27-29">Stt 27.27-29</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 27:39-40">39-40</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">Aisege</char> e Godefea <char style="bd"><char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char></char> amofea alefasia, ehe Yekobodai, Isodaifea, kegele aalufea dufia holobagaeyobafe amone <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba ofa</char> sulu solu.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 47:31-48:20">Stt 47.31–48.20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">Yekobo</char> e Godefea <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> amofea alefasia, e olaeyo hagoalesia, <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[1]], Yekobone faibe hugulubamone ulenomo, e">Yosebene</char> faibe aida amofea ediliba ofa sulu solu. <char style="qt">Kaidamo ene seba ado hau amofea, waafia, anifia ligia, e Godefea gulugululu.</char><verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 50:24-25">Stt 50.24-25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:19">Kis 13.19</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">Yosebe</char> e Godefea <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> amofea alefasia, e olaeyo hagoalesiamo, e saaba ofa selesia, dufiamo <char style="w">Isolaele</char> ili Isibi hele gadefia maiyobafe. Aufia, ili abiamo, ene kiwimo dibia malaleba solu.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 1:22">Kis 1.22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 2:2">2.2</ref></char>
    </note> <char style="it"><char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesene</char> enaedai enaodai</char>, aaluda <char style="bd"><char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char></char> amofea alefasia, aine faibe subobomo muguba ufulu. Fogo ami, Isibine kini, Felau, ehe Isolaelene inolo faibe subobo sunia yasoba danemaleba saaba ufulubiyo. Auluso, aaluhe sulu auba saaba ufulu amo sagilisiale, Mosese seba difasia, e faibe yogolelu labe baafia, e muguba ufia ligia, aube osoloa alolu.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Ausi, kini Felaune elewelihe e fofoba dulu. <char style="it">Mosese</char> auba fofoba labi, e bulefasia, asidalu adesimo, e <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> amofea alefasia, ilihe e-mo kini Felaune eleweline faibeba, auba samesialesia haboba alolu. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />E Felaune enauwa ligia, e elebeda dulu inolo asulubiyo. Auba ligia, ene miliyolu usu e <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolune</char> nenalebalu kegele naba alebaiyo. Auluso, auba misiyomo afelesia, e Godene idele inolodai naga ua diyone daalu. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Ehe elebe nafulu Gode alefasia efea meyobafe amone ama hiliseba ligia, e bisigia, yualo e <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> wi saabia dife amohe, Isibine moleda, momadada, kegeleda amo wasolu dobi abulu.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />
    <char style="it">Mosese</char> ene <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> amofea alefasia, e Isibi kinine kanolo bule amone baaba sagilisiale, e Isibi gadefia daalu. Idele inolone simo Gode bolaleso, Mosese e Gode bologulu alefasia, e kiwigaafia alolu.<verse eid="HEB 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:21-30">Kis 12.21-30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">Mosese</char> <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> amofea alefasia, <char style="w">Obegeba Dulumone Henesia Sigilo</char> amone manamo e maugalu. Dufa Dafalilo ehe inigia, ine faibe olaibomo dufa dafalimesiale, Mosesehe, idele inolofeamo, dofene sibi edone ibimo gefasia, eno salibane higidai, keadaifea, heeba yaamaleba solu. <figure style="fig" alt="Painting blood over the door" file="IB04152.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used by permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="11.28">Dofene sibi edone ibi eno salibane higidai, keadaifea, heefe.</figure><verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:21-31">Kis 14.21-31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">Isolaele idele inolo</char> ili Godefea <char style="bd"><char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char></char> amofea alefasia, salu hano Genelumo osolaba dafelesia, hele falalu holobagasi, ili amo segeba dedalelu. Auluso, ili aafe auba, Isibi inolo ilida auba maiyone dedeba kuliba aasi, ilimo hano amo gifiaba daneba yaalu.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 6:12-21">Jos 6.12-21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">Isolaele idele inolo</char> ili Godefea <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> amofea alefasia, Yeligo dauno bulemo, hilia domoba amohe amaleba galisi, Yeligo dauno abane yalaba galilu amo, ene asiba olaboba suga dalelu.<verse eid="HEB 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Jos 2.1-21</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 6:21-25">6.21-25</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 2:25">Yem 2.25</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">Susugu ido <char style="w">Lahabo</char></char> e Godefea <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> amofea alefasia, Isolaele inolo aida aibasilo mulumo heneba uluba alolu. Aulune, Godene sulu saidafolo idele inolo amo dufa danesimo, e ilidai ua dufa olaluale.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 6:11-8:32">Het 6.11–8.32</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:6-5:31">4.6–5.31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:2-16:31">13.2–16.31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:1-12:7">11.1–12.7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:1-2:11">1Sml 1.1–1Kin 2.11</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, sulu amone haisimo, na halaguba gegoaba saeyobi? <char style="it">Gidiyonoda</char>, <char style="it">Balagoda</char>, <char style="it">Samosonoda</char>, <char style="it">Yefededa</char>, aufia <char style="it"><char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidida</char></char>, <char style="it">Samueleda</char>, aufia <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo ilida, ili moloba alolu amomo, gilifea awaeyo hilisefeso, na fogo malebu.<verse eid="HEB 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 6:1-2">Dan 6.1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">Inolo ili amone</char> <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> amofea alefasia, ilihe kini noolodai belagulumo, kaamo alolu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="HEB 11:33">Isoluale besabemo, ili isoba moloba ofolo.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="HEB 11:33">Aufia, Godehe ilifea meyoba oloba huliale saaba ufulu amone, ili dulu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="HEB 11:33">Aufia, ilihe <char style="w">laeono</char> amone mofeyo gaduba yaalu.<verse eid="HEB 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 3:23-27">Dan 3.23-27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ine <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> amohe, de waiya bulemo usuba dafulu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="HEB 11:34">Helebesi ili dufa olaeyo weiyaasi, ili siba dafia dedalelu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="HEB 11:34">Aufia, ili kiwi saneba yaalu adesimo, Godehe ili kiwigaaba ufulu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="HEB 11:34">Aufia, ilihe belagusia, kiwigagalu adesia, hele nolobalone yobolo inolomo aiba gasaba dafalilu.<verse eid="HEB 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 17:17-24">1Kin 17.17-24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:25-37">2Kin 4.25-37</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">Idele noolo</char> ine <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> amofea alefasia, Godehe ine faibe olalumo <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba</char> ifofasia, inefea obegeba melu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 11:35" />
  <para style="li" vid="HEB 11:35">
    <char style="it">Idele inolo noolomo,</char> ine <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> hamesifia, gisa inolohe ilimo yaminiba yaalu. Auba yaminiba yaasia, gisa inolohe ilifea selesia, “Ga Godefea faiso mesenaga, na ga waagi beega malaleyo”. Auluso, ili beega maiyomo hiliseluale. Maumo, ili olafia, haiba degesia, miliyolu miliyo nafulu koleba diyo amone hilisefia, ami ili waagi yaminimesi kalugaalu.<verse eid="HEB 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:26-27">1Kin 22.26-27</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:2">Jer 20.2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:15">37.15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:6">38.6</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">Noolomo</char>, gisa inolohe ilimo gaidabofasia, efolo fegosia, seini dofaba yaafia, dibolo dafaliba ilogolu.<verse eid="HEB 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 24:21">2Sto 24.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="it">Noolomo,</char> olamesi ilihe abane odaba yaalu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="HEB 11:37">
    <char style="it">Noolomo,</char> sohe, ine domalamo olofa haganaba yaalu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="HEB 11:37">
    <char style="it">Noolomo,</char> helebe bainadene sihe dufa danelu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 11:37" />
  <para style="li" vid="HEB 11:37">Aufia, <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> <char style="it">idele inolo noolo </char> ili wida male adesia, kegeledale ligia, meme badodai, sibi badodaimo fagulo kakaloguba, kakafia siba alolu.</para>
  <para style="li" vid="HEB 11:37">Noolohe <char style="it">ilimo</char> elasabiasia, naga meba yaalu.<verse eid="HEB 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Helefealune wolu idele inolo ili hilisesia, <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> idele inolo ninidai ua misiyone lilibuale. Auba hilisesia, ilihe ili aiba gasalu. Ausi, ilimo hele galeada, hele falaiyada sibaisaba ligiamo, sowaea libodai, hele kalebadai haneba alolu.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="m" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />
    <char style="it">Idele inolo ili amo sunia</char>, <char style="bd">asigi ule ufulu</char> amofea alefasia, Godehe ili amofea wi nafulu koleba mesia, wabialeba selaba yaalu. Auluso, ili amo helefealu iwi sigiamo, Gode ilifea oloba huliale meyoba saaba ufulu amo, ili aso duluale. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Mau enebamo, samini waagi, Godehe nineba nafulu olaibo koleba madeneba ufulu. Aulune, nini aso male labi, Ehe ilidale aso nafulu moloba samodoyo hamefale. Aubale. Ehe nine fogo holobagamesi yasifia, ninidai, ilidai, ua nafulu moloba samodoyo hamefe. Mau amofea alefasia, ili oloba huliale saaba ufulu amo dibale ligia, aso yasiba alolu.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Ninihe Yesu bisigia, Efea asigi ule ufiyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 9:24-25">1Kld 9.24-25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Asigi ule ufulu idele inolo samini wedinale alebaiba yaalu ilimo, kene iwagulu nini amaleba galifia ligia, asigi ule ufulune mana amo ninifea walesia, amaleba galifia alebaibu. Aulune, nini naguba abia, kegele sunia ninida kaafemo diba dafelesia, mana <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> ninida saabia saabiaba dofaba yaabu amoda, gegeleba yaafia, gadefia, naguba maiyoba. Godehe nini naguba malesi iminiba ufuluiya ami abiamo, kiwi sanefia afelesiale, naguba maiyoba. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Nini auba naguba dedaleba ligiamo, nine sihe Yesusu koleba si galiba sidafia ligia, naguba dedaleyoba. Nine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> amone eno saminiba aafeda, ililiba ufiyoda, Yesu amo E labe. E dufia henelo diyobafe amone asigisiamo, <char style="w">imolane</char> amo Ene digilu. Imolane ami olasia, yualo difemo momoleba hilisesiale, kiwi sanefia afelesiale, naga bule dulu. Aufasia, E-mo Godene asefalu ailaiya inaloafealo ami yoba asulu. <verse eid="HEB 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Yesu mololu amone gili nafuluba asigima. <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">Wolu mololo</char> inolo ilihe, Yesufea higinilu mesimo, E kiwi sanefia afelesiale, kiwigaafia kalugaalu. Aulugulu, gili habomabiyo. Gine libo ogo kiwi bibiliba adesiale, gili Yesufea asigi gagabasu mela.<verse eid="HEB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe ninifea higinilu mefemo, nini isoyone aulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Seale, gili mana <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">woludai</char> belagulabia dedaleba labeso, gili ibi anosiba momoleba hiliseba ligia, gine kiwi sunia aso meba samodobale belaguba ado. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.5-6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:11-12">Snd 3.11-12</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 5:17">Jop 5.17</ref>; <ref loc="REV 3:19">MUU 3.19</ref></char></note>Aufia gilimo, Godehe gine libo ogo kiwigaaba ofelesia, sulu solu amo, gili asigi galifia elela? Ehe gilimo Ene faibeba iminisia, selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 12:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">
    <char style="qt">“Ne naalo, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> ga isosia, halaleba selesenaga,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">
    <char style="qt">amo E balu selefeba hilisemabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, mana gafea selefe amofea ga bonesia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">
    <char style="qt">ge libo ogo higiniba koleba melabiyo.</char><verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />
    <char style="qt">Maumo, idele inolo Saminilohe hamesefe ili amomo, E isolo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:6">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, idele inolo Ehe heneba uluba difasia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:6">
    <char style="qt">ilifea Ne faibeba selefe ili amomo, Ehe isosia, ilifea mana saeyobafe.”</char><verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:5">Lo 8.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godehe gili waagi isomesi, gili koleba kiwigaaba kalugaafia melale. Godehe mana gilifea auba mololomo, enaohe ene faibe isologuba aulo. Ene enaohe isolale faibe uleno labela? Auba male. <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Aubamo, Godehe Ene faibe alebaibu ili amo sunia isologulu, Ehe gili isosalenaga, amo gili seale Godene faibeale. Ausenaga, gili amo enaoda male, seba dafulu faibegulu labe. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Sulu no ewene asigima. Helefealu iwimo, nine naodalihe nini isosimo, ninimo ili sisa ligia, ine sulu selefe kuliba ano. Aubamo, ninihe nine asubanene Nao hebene labe amone sisa adesia, Ene sulu selefe kuliba maiyoba. Auba ausimo, nini miliyolu diyobafe. <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Hilia fogo abobo ewemo, nine nao helefealu iwi labe ilihe, ine asigifeguba kuliba abiamo, nini isoba yaalo. Auluso, Godehe nini isofemo, nini huliane waseba dimesifia isolo. Ausi, nini Ene elalelu amo ua osolaba disia, <char style="w" lemma="Noekene">noekene</char> miliyobafe. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 3:17-18">Yem 3.17-18</ref></char></note>Ehe nini isosimo, nini naga bosolugulu, henelale. Auluso, nini isosimo, mana amone dawaloba disiamo, isofe amone sebe heleyobafegulu, ninihe mana isolu molosia, onaba misiyobafe.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:3">Ais 35.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, gili gine sone bedegaba sugafemoda, gine emo hugulumo kiwi saneba yaafemoda, kiwigaamesi moloba homa. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 4:26">Snd 4.26</ref></char></note><char style="qt">Eno gilida maiyomo nafuluba felama</char>. Auba molosimo, gine emo haugelumo saabia no woba damesiale, waiba waaleyobafe.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nini Godene sulu saidafolosi, haguguba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Gilimo, idele inolo suniadai nafuluba onaba miliyone, migagaba malale. Aufia, gili Godedai <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> moloba ofelesi miliyone, asigi kiwigaafia, migagaba malale. Idele inolo muuba kalilu melesi moloba ofelefale amo, ilihe Saminilo babiyobafale. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Gili aleba ami, ulenohe Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> manamo balubusia, suniabailosi, nafuluba si kolafia, yasifia melale. Gili aleba ugi, i folofolo sobolosi, nafuluba bamale. Enebamo, ga i folofologulu adesenaga, ge suluda, ge manada, idele inolo noolo dabagalaba ofelesia, wedinale medeyobafe. Auba mololosi, gili yasifia melale. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Stt 25.29-34</ref></char></note>Gili aleba ugi, ulenohe susugu mana moloba adosi, nafuluba bamale. Aufia, ulenohe, Isogulu adesia, Godene kanululomo balubusia afolosi, nafuluba bamale. Iso e-mo, ene daalo, e olaibo faibegulu, dufia diyo ufulu amone, afelesia, naiyo fofalu wedino amohe elegeba dulu. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:30-40">Stt 27.30-40</ref></char></note>Efea holobagalu amo gili asigibu. Dufia, ehe <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">edililo</char> diyosia, daalo haiba dibaiyeba weiyaaluso, enaohe efea meyodoluale alolu. Ausi, ehe edililo haiba diyofia, e mololu mana haiba duguba obegeyone, eno isasia susiba yeeluso, eno male abulu.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sagiliyo hele galedai, heneyo hele galedai, amone saaba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:16-20">Kis 19.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:11-12">Lo 4.11-12</ref></char>
    </note>Gili Gode labea inigiamo, hele gine si babiyoda, gine sone geyo amoda, ami goaluale. Samini Isolaele ili Gode labea maiyone eno kuliba daaluguba, gili daaluale. Samini ilimo, Sainai galea hagoaleba milifasia ligia, de waiya buleda, nigiligagalu buleda bisigia, mogaifo gala bule amoda dubulu. <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">Kis 20.18-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:22-27">Lo 5.22-27</ref></char></note>Aufia, ilihe fuufe galamo dofasia, Godene suluda ami selesi dubulu. Idele inolohe sulu amone dobolaba yaasia, ili sagili bule adesia, Mosesefea susiba auba solu. “Godehe ninifea sulu haiba saabia no sodosi, gahe sulu Efea saama.” <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:12-13">Kis 19.12-13</ref></char></note>Maumo, ilihe sulu Gode ilifea solu amo baaba sagililu. Enebamo, saminimo, Godehe ilifea eweguba solubiyo. <char style="qt">“Inolonagada, me kelebulunagada, hele gale amo gesenaga, gilihe e-mo abane odesia, dufa olamale.”</char> <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">Lo 9.19</ref></char></note>Sainai galea moloba yaafe ewehe, idele inolo sunia sagiliba ofelesi, <char style="w">Mosese</char> eda eweguba solu, <char style="qt">“Nada sagili bule adesia, bibilife.</char>”<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Auluso, aga gilimo Sainai galea ami goabuale. Aubale. Gili Saiono galea ami goabu. <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">Hebenene</char> Yelusalame, Gode Bebea Saabe Amone sidimo, galea ami dobu. Gilimo, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> daosenene daosene wedinalemo alebaibia ami goabu. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Aufia, olaibo damenesu sunia heneba ligia, gagaiyoba alebaibia ami, gilida milibaifia goabu. Olaibo damene amone wimo, <char style="w">hebene</char> lagi bugo usu ami seleba waalebu. Aufia, helefealu idele inolo suniada osolalo Gode E labea ami, gili goabu. Godehe idele inolo nafulu isolu moloba ufulu amone asubane alebaibia ami, gili goabu. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 8:6">Hib 8.6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 4:10">Stt 4.10</ref></char></note>Gili Yesu labea ami goabu. Ehe <char style="w">oloba huliale dabalu</char> hili mololu ewene kiwigaaba ufiyone, E-mo Godedai, ninidai, olea inolo labe. Gilimo Yesune ibi gasaliba doweiya ami goabu. Yesune ibi sulu selefe amohe, <char style="w" lemma="Aibele">Aibelene</char> ibi sulu solumo sunialu labe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aibele </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dufa olasi, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ene ibi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo Gode labea holobagasiamo, sabemaba solu. (Stat 4.10 ami alegama.) Auluso, </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yesune ibi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amohe Godefea sabemabiyoba selesiamo, nine wolumo hamasia heefasia, galiba nini beega mesesi gadefalu.</char></note><verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HEB 2:1-3">Hib 2.1-3</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 10:26-29">10.26-29</ref></char>
    </note>Gili nafuluba melale. Gilihe Yesune ibihe aga sulu selefemone dobelesia, golaba domabiyo. Samini helefealu iwi sigiamo, Godehe sulu kolelu Isolaelene idele inolofea saaba melu. Auluso, ilihe sulu amo golaba dobelesia, kuliba daalualemo, ili amo elaba dafia, fisaba daaluale. Aulugulu, sulu Yesuhe hebenefia ninifea selefemo golaba dobelesia, ninihe Efea faiso mesenaga, amo ninida siba dafia maiyobafale koleba. <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag 2.6</ref></char></note>Fogo amoyamo, Godehe sulu Sainai galea ami selesimo, Ene sulu amohe helefealu waminilu. Auluso, aga Ehe oloba huliale sulu eweguba solu dobu. “<char style="qt">Hilia uluseno, Nahe helefealu ewe haiba no waminiba ufiyo. Amo helefealu ewesuale. Anakiwida, Nahe waminiba ufiyo.</char>” <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />“No haiba waminiba ufiyoba” selefe amone sisamo, ewe. Gode Ene mololu kegele dobu ewemo, Ehe waminiba ofelesi, ili amo kalugagafia miliyobafale. Aubale. Waminilale kegele amonesu kalugaafia melesi gadefaeyobafe. <verse eid="HEB 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Aulugulu, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amo nini disu ewemo, waminiyobafale koleba. Aulune, ninimo heneba ligia, wisoba selaba miliyoba. Ninimo Efea gulugulusia, E sisa adesia, E hamefeguba moloba miliyoba. <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Lo 4.24</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:3">9.3</ref></char></note>Maumo, <char style="qt">nine Gode E-mo, de waiya koleluhe kegele sunia naba samodologuba, Ehe wolu sunia naba samodoyobafe</char>.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Gode henemesi ninihe nine geleba seale hameseyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Keliso idele inolo gilihe, gine gelewodali, ganodalimo, seale koleba bule hameselabia daaba mela.<verse eid="HEB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:13">Lom 12.13</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 18:1-8">Stt 18.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:1-3">19.1-3</ref></char>
    </note>Inolo gili labea sobele saabi, ili heneba uluba ado mana amo hamabiyo. Maumo, hilia no, inolo noolohe sobele inolo auba heneba uluba alolumo, ili amohe <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> uluba alolu. Auluso, ilihe ilimo Godene sulu dia ano amobuba hilisebale ligia, inolo balu sobele saabebusia, heneba uluba alolu. Aulugulu, gilihe sobele saabe inolo amo sunia heneba uluba melale.<verse eid="HEB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Aufia, idele inolo dibolo saabe ili amo, gilihe nafuluba asigimale. Gilida ili galiba ua dibolo loluba hilisesia, ili amo yagunagamale. Aufia, noolohe idele inolofea naga mesi, higini ili dife amo, gili asigima. Naga ili dife amo, gilida ili galiba ua disuba hilisesia, yagunagamale.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:5">Efe 5.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, ido disiamo, idele inolo noolone si saabia ifofasia, fogaba ido dimale. Aufasia, aali aalibisu melale. Ido duluhe aine molobu ogomo, Godene si saabia nugumadale melesi, ainesu ufia melale. Inolo abehe ido fa dife amoda, susugu molofe amoda, Godehe mau fadaafasia, ili amo osolaeyobafe.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 31:6">Lo 31.6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Jos 1.5</ref></char>
    </note>Mole bule koleba hamemabiyo. Kegele gafea dobu ogomo, isoba dobuba hilisesia, henefia melale. Maumo, Godehe eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 13:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:5">
    <char style="qt">“Na ga faiso meyale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:5">
    <char style="qt">Ga gelebi hafinilu melesi, gadefaeyale koleba.”</char><verse eid="HEB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:6">Sng 118.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, nini auba asigifia, kiwigaafia kalugaasiamo, eweguba saeyoba.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 13:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">
    <char style="qt">“<char style="w">Saminilo</char> Ehe na sagoba ofologulu, na sagiliyale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">
    <char style="qt">Helefealu inolohe kegele uleno nafea moloyobafale.”</char><verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:16">1Kld 4.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gilihe, sesene guni inolo, Godene sulu manada gilifea walelo alebaibu amo, nafuluba asigimale. Ili adabia inigia samodosia, sebe helelu mana amomo gili osolaba bafasia, hilisefiasu ligia, gilihe ine <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> hamagubasu kuliba malale.<verse eid="HEB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char> E-mo, aideda, agada, hilia suniada, E dedegelale alefalu hamagulu labe.<verse eid="HEB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 14:17">Lom 14.17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, sulu nokene nokeneba walefe amohe, gine libomo sigisi, gili Godene sulu gadefia anosi, fogo memabiyo. Naiyo nokene nokeneba naiyone aiyasia, kuliba daalu amohe, inolo uleno sagoba ufulualegulu, gilida mana hamagubasu molosenaga, amo gilida sagoba ufiyobafale. Aubale. Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> amohe, nine libo kiwigaaba ofelesia, nini uluba ligia, sagoba ofolo. <verse eid="HEB 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Nine wolu heemesimo, Yesu E Ene domala amone ulu melugulu, kegele nafulu E moloiya ami holobagalumo amo, nini disu. Auluso, inolo abehe, eno samini ufulu amo kuliba abia, kelebuluda soba mefe amo ilifea, kegele nafulu amo waagi dimabiyoba solu.<verse eid="HEB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 16:27">Wkp 16.27</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">Soba melone guni inolohe</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> heemesifia, soba meyone kelebulune ibimo difasia, Maleelu <char style="w">Noekene</char> Hogolilu elalolu usu amohe dibia sugalo. Auluso, kelebulu amone badomo, ilihe yala faisa baea dibia dafasia, de soba dagilo. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:17">Yon 19.17</ref></char></note>Auba mololu amoguba, Yesu Ene ibihe idele inolo Godedai <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu melesi moloba ofolo">muuba kalilu melesi moloba ufiyo</char> labimo, ilihe E-mo sidi yalalu amone fafa faisa baea dia daafia, E-da ami naga dulu. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:2">Hib 12.2</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, ninida yalalu amone fafa faisa E labea daafia, ninida yualo E dulu hamaguba diyoba. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:10">Hib 11.10</ref>, <ref loc="HEB 11:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:22">12.22</ref></char></note>Maumo, nini asigisia, sidi ninida helefealu iwi kakainabu ewemo, alefalu miliyobafale. Aubale. Sidi dufia holobagaeyobafea ami misiyone, nini migagaba aasu.<verse eid="HEB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 50:14">Sng 50.14</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 50:23">23</ref></char>
    </note>Yesuhe nini Gode labea milesi, eno hili sogoba ufulugulu, ulu kegele Godefea soba melo amoguba, ninihe Gode Ene wisu digiba selaba miliyoba. Nine mofeyohe, Ene wi ulufaba selaba miliyoba. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:18">Fil 4.18</ref></char></note>Ulu soba melogulu mana no Gode henefe amo, ewe. Gili mana nafulune nafulu idele inolo ilifea molosiamo, kegele gili dobu amo, gine geleba ua osolaba diaba melale.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 5:12">1Des 5.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gine seseda yasilo guni inolo ilihe, dufiamo, dabalu ili moloba alolu amo, Godefea waleyobafegulu, ilihe gilimo nafuluba uluba labe. Aulune, gili ili amo sisa ligia, sulu ili selefemo nafuluba kuliba daaba melale. Ausenaga, ili amo dabalu heneba moloyobafe. Ilihe ine dabalu molosia, hogolosia naga sogoolosi, gilihe ilifea higinilu memabiyo. Enebamo, ilihe gili uluba ligiamo, higinifia adesenaga, amohe gilifea nafulu molosia sagoba ufiyobafale.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 24:16">HD 24.16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 1:12">2Kld 1.12</ref></char>
    </note>Godehe nini sagoba homesi, gili koleba Edai sulu selaba melale. Nini kegele suniafealo molosiamo, mana isolusu moloyo hamefe. Aulune, nine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi nafulune si">asigine si</char> sawaba bisigia, Godene si saabiamo, nini mana isoba moloba labi besabe. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Na gilifea kiwigaaba selesu. Na gili labea alebale milesimo, gilihe na sagoba ofelesia, Godedai sulu selaba melale.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 32:40">Jer 32.40</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:26">Ese 37.26</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:25">1Fid 2.25</ref></char>
    </note>Nine Saminilo Yesumo, <char style="w">Dofene Sibi</char> Uluba Ado kiwidamo, E labe. Ene ibi amofea alefasia, Ehe <char style="w">oloba huliale dabalu</char> hili moloyone maugalu. Dabalu amo alefalu ufiasu miliyobafe. Aulune, Godehe E-mo olaiyafia haiba degeba ifolu. <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />Aufia, agamo, aeaba ofolo Gode Ehe, gine miliyolu aleba ugi, mana nafulu sunia holobagamesi moloba ofelesi, gilimo Ene hame kuliba maiyobafe. Ehe gine miliyolu aleba ugi, auba moloba ligia, nine miliyolu aleba iwi, E heneba ufiyone moloyobafe. Ene hame auba molomesi, Efea fogo meyoba.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="HEB 13:21" />
  <para style="qc" vid="HEB 13:21">
    <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">Elalelumo</char>, Efea alefalu miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="HEB 13:21">
    <char style="sls">
      <char style="w">Amen</char>.</char> Amo seale koleba.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elosia sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Ne damenedali, gine libo ogo kiwigaamesi, sowi ewehe sulu aboboba gilifea selemesu. Sulu amo gilihe nafuluba dofasia, nafuluba asigiba dimale.<verse eid="HEB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Nine nelewo <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodi</char> dibolo asulumo, sububa dafogoluso. Nahe gili auba asigimesi selesu. E-mo na labea alebale goasenaga, anihe gili babiyone gili labea miyobasu.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Gine seseda uluba ado suniafeada, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene idele inolo</char> suniafeada, na hawiyoba selesomale. Hele Idali amone keliso damene nadai alebaibu ilida, gilifea hawiyoba seleso.<verse eid="HEB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Godene <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululomo</char> gili suniadai miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HEB 13:25">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="EndOfBookOnobasulu_Epistles.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="13.25" /><verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>